    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Muusa nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame: B soka Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) ned sẽn na n zabd raood yĩnga, la ned sẽn na n zabd buud yĩnga, la ned sẽn na n zabd maan-tɩ-b-yã yĩnga, bãmbã fãa gillã ãnd n be Wẽnd sorã zugu? Tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã yeele (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ): «Ned ning sẽn zabda n rat tɩ Wẽnd yʋʋrã zẽk n yɩɩdã, yẽ soab bee Wẽnd sorã zugu».",
    "explanation": "B soka Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) nebã Anniy-rãmbã sẽn yõs taaba, ned sẽn na n zabd sũ-keglem maa buudu maa maan-tɩ-b-yã yĩnga, maa zẽng sẽn ka rẽ, bãmbã sʋka ãnd n be Wẽnd sorã zugu? Tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) kõ kibare, tɩ ned ning sẽn zabda Wẽnd sorã zugã, yẽ la sẽn zabd tɩ Wẽnd yʋʋrã na zẽk n yɩɩdã.",
    "hints": [
          "Bũmb ning sẽn yaa yẽgr tʋʋmã manegr la b sãang wεεngẽ wã ad yaa Anniy wã, la tʋʋmdã yɩlgr tɩ yɩ Wẽnd A Yembr yĩnga.",
          "Raabã gɩhaadɩẽ wã sã n yɩɩme tɩ yaa Wẽnd yʋʋrã na zẽke, tɩ bũmb a to paase, sãri wã sẽn kõ sore, wala arzεkã wʋkre, yẽnda ka sãamd Anniy wã reegr ye.",
