    "hadeeth": "Yii a Anas nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) a kodga pe-raad a yiibu, sẽn yaa pεεl sẽn tẽgs sabla n tar yɩɩla, a kodg-b lame ne a nugã, la a yeel \"bismillaah\" la \"Allaahu akbarʋ\" la a rɩk a naoorã n ning b yiibã yubliẽ wã.",
    "explanation": "A Anas kõo kibare (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) a kodga ne a nugã, kibsã tigri raare, pe-raad a yiibu, sẽn yaa pεεl sẽn tẽgs sabla n tar yɩɩla, la a yeel \"bismillaah\" la \"Allaahu akbarʋ\" la a rɩk a naoorã n ning b yiibã yubliẽ wã.",
    "hints": [
          "Yaa sẽn wilgd tɩ sãrĩ wã kõo sore ne kibsã rũng kodgre, la moeembã fãa tigima taab a zugu.",
          "Sẽn yɩɩd sõmblem yaa t'a yɩ kõbg-kãngã ning Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) sẽn kodgã; a gesrã neerem yĩnga, la a kaamã ne a nemdã noom sẽn yɩɩdã.",
