          "A An-nawawɩy yeelame: wãnde yaa zeng-raoogo sẽn kell n tongdẽ balɑ sãri wã pʋgẽ, la rẽ yaa tɩ bũmb ning sẽn yaa waoogrã la zɩsgrã, wala fut yeelgo la kurs tãoobo la na-wʋʋd suiibu, la misg ningri, la rao-wãbdga la kɩro ningri la nus-yẽes wõrsgo la no-kõbd wõrsgo la zoobd sãasgo la kõbd tõsbo, la zug põngre, la sallem ningr Pʋʋsgẽ wã la yĩn-wilã pekr yɩlgrẽ wã, la we-kεεngẽ yiibu, la rɩɩbẽ la yũubẽ, la Pʋʋsgo, la Kug-sabellã mokr Maka, la zẽng sẽn ka rẽnda, sẽn kẽed woto maanã, b bʋʋ nonglem tɩ b sɩng ne rɩtgo. La sã n yaa bũmb sẽn yɑɑ wãnde tullã; wɑlɑ ko-soodgẽ kẽebo, la miisr pʋg yiibẽ, lɑ koom zẽkre, la fuug la kuirg yeegre, la na-wʋʋd yãkre, la sẽn wõnd rẽnda b bʋʋ nonglem tɩ b reng n sɩng ne goabga, la wãnde fãa yaa rɩtg waoogr la a zɩsgre.",
          "B sẽn yeel tɩ \"Rɩtgã sɩngrã\" noom-a lame wã, a gũbga sɩngr tʋʋmã fãa pʋgẽ ne rɩtg nugã la rɩtg nɑoorã, la rɩtg wεεngẽ, la bũmb rɩkre la a kɩsbo ne rɩtgo.",
          "A An-nawawɩy yeelame: bãnge, tɩ ad koomã yõgb yĩn-wilẽ wã bee beenẽ, b sẽn ka bʋ nonlem tɩ b sɩng ne rɩtg ye, la bãmb la tʋb a yiibã la tal a yiibã la yεgds a yiibã, bãmba b kelled n pek-b-la vugr tãa bala, la sã n ka tõog woto, wala ned ning nug sẽn kʋrge, la sẽn wõnd rẽnda; a sɩngda rɩtgã.",
        ],
