    "hadeeth": "Yii a Anas ɭbn Maalik nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋm, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeelame: «zems-y soaf-rãmbã ne taaba, ad Soaf-rãmbã tẽesgã bee Pʋʋsgã pidsg pʋgẽ».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) sagenda pʋʋsdbã tɩ b tẽeg b soaf-rãmbã tɩrga, la sãnda ra lʋɩ taoor tɩ sãnda be poorẽ ye, la b bãng tɩ soaf-rãmbã tẽeg tɩrgã, a lagema Pʋʋsgã pidbẽ, la b bãng tɩ soaf-rãmbã golengo a yaa keoosg Pʋʋsgã pʋgẽ.",
