    "title": "Mam ka tol n yã Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) t'a wɩsg a meng n laadẽ, halɩ tɩ b yã a ragsendakã ye, la a laadã rag n yaa no-yõgengo",
    "hadeeth": "Yii Muumin-dãmbã mɑ wã a ʿAɑɩša nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame: Mam ka tol n yã Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) t'a wɩsg a meng n laadẽ, halɩ tɩ b yã a ragsendakã ye, la a laadã rag n yaa no-yõgengo.",
