  3062: {
    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "Fighu wã ne Yẽgã",
    "title": "M gũusa Nabiyaamã nengẽ (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) rakaar-rãmb piiga",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ɭbn ʿƲmar nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga), a yeelame: M gũusa Nabiyaamã nengẽ (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) rakaar-rãmb piiga: rakaar a yiibu taoor tɩ Zafar na n ka ta, la rakaar a yiibu Zafar poorẽ, la rakaar a yiibu Magrib poorẽ a zakẽ wã, la rakaar a yiibu sãanf poorẽ a zakẽ, la rakaar a yiibu taaor tɩ fagir na n ka pʋʋse, lɑ ɑ ra yaa wakat ned sẽn ka kẽed Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) nengẽ sasa-kãngã, a Hafsa togsa maam tɩ laandãan boaalã sã n wa boole, tɩ fagirã sã n puki, Nabiyaamã pʋʋsda rakaar a yiibu, lɑ gom-bila a to pʋgẽ a yeelame tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) ra yɩɩme n pʋʋsd arzũm poorẽ rakaar a yiibu.",
    "explanation": "A ʿAbdʋllaah ɭbn ʿƲmar vẽnegdame n wilgdẽ (Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga) tɩ naafɩl-rãmb nins yẽ sẽn gũus Nabiyaamã nengẽ wã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) yaa piiga, la b boonda bãmb tɩ As-Sunan Arrawaatɩb (Sun tũnugdsi), rakaar a yiibu taoor tɩ Zafar na n ka ta, la rakaar a yiibu Zafar poorẽ, la rakaar a yiibu Magrib poorẽ a zakẽ wã, la rakaar a yiibu Sãanf poorẽ a zakẽ, la rakaar a yiibu taoor tɩ Fagir na n ka pʋʋse, Tɩ rɑkaɑr piigã yaa sẽn pidi. La sã n yaa arzũmã Pʋʋsgo, a maanda rakaar a yiibu a poorẽ.",
    "hints": [
          "Wilgda b sẽn bʋ nonglem ne naafɩl-kãensã tũnugrã la b tabl b zugu.",
          "Sari wã sẽn wilgd tɩ b maand Sunnah zagsẽ wã.",
