    "title": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) ra yɩɩme t'a sã n yik yʋngo, a sẽdgda a noorã ne sɩgdre",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Hʋzayfa nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) ra yɩɩme t'a sã n yik yʋngo, a sẽdgda a noorã ne sɩgdre.",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) ra yɩɩme, noor wʋsg fãa, a sẽdgda a noorã, la a sagend tɩ b maan woto, la yel-kãng kengdame wakat sãnda pʋgẽ, sẽn be b pʋgẽ: sẽdg f noorã f sẽn wat n yik yʋngo, bala (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) ra yɩɩme, n sẽdgdẽ la a yɩlgda a noorã ne sɩgdre.",
