    "category": "Fighu wã ne Yẽgã",
    "title": "Yãmb yembr fãa ka yεεsd t'a sã n reng limaamã n roog a zugã, tɩ Wẽnd nɑ n maan a zugã tɩ lebg bõang zugu, maa A maan a yĩngã tɩ lebg bõang yĩnga",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Hʋrayrat nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga),  tɩ yii Nɑbiyɑɑmã nengẽ, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) yeelame: «Yãmb yembr fãa ka yεεsd t'a sã n reng limaamã n roog a zugã, tɩ Wẽnd nɑ n maan a zugã tɩ lebg bõang zugu, maa A maan a yĩngã tɩ lebg bõang yĩnga».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) vẽnega pʋleng wẽng kεgeng ning sẽn be ne ned ning sẽn roogd a zugã, taoor tɩ limaamã ka roogã, tɩ Wẽnd na n maana a zugã bõang zugu, maa A maan a yĩngã tɩ lebg bõang yĩnga.",
