  3142: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã rag n yɩɩme  (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) n wʋsgd n yetẽ: «Yaa muƙallib al-ƙuluub ṯabbit ƙalbiy ʿalaa diinik= Foom a sũyã Toεεmda tablg mam sũurã Fo dĩinã zugu",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Anas nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã rag n yɩɩme  (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) n wʋsgd n yetẽ: «Yaa muƙallib al-ƙuluub ṯabbit ƙalbiy ʿalaa diinik= Foom a sũyã Toεεmda tablg mam sũurã Fo dĩinã zugu», tɩ mam yeele:  Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã, tõnd kõo sɩd ne foom la fo sẽn wa ne bũmb ningã, la rẽ yĩnga fo yεεsdame tɩ tõnd na menem bɩɩ? La a yeel yã: «n-yee, ad sũyã bee nus-biya a yiib sʋka, sẽn yaa Wẽnd nus-biyã, t'A lεεbd-b A sẽn tʋll to-to».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kosg wʋsg fãa rag n yɩɩme, a sẽn kot Wẽnd t'A tabend-a dĩinã la tũudmã zugu, la zãag n yi kedgr la menengo, t'a Anas ɭbn Maalik maan yel-solemde (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) Nabiyaamã Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) sẽn wʋsgd ne doaag-kãngã, t'a kõ-a kibare (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) tɩ ad sũya b bee nus-biya a yiib sʋka sẽn yaa Wẽnd nus-biyã, t'A toeemd-b wala A sẽn rate, Rẽnd sũurã, ad yaa yẽnda la sɩd-kũuna la kɩfẽndã zĩigã, la ad b pʋda sũuri tɩ Ƙalbʋ (lebgre) a sẽn leebd wʋsgã yĩnga, bala yẽnda n leebd n yɩɩd yʋʋre, tɩ yʋʋrã sã n pid n kota, la Wẽnd sẽn tʋll a soaba, A zĩndigda a sũurã kãndgr zugu, la a tablg-a dĩinã zugu, la Wẽnd sẽn tʋll a soaba A wẽnegd a sũurã n yi kãndgrã n tʋg kedgr la menengo.",
    "hints": [
          "Wilgda Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) gãneg-m-mengã ne a Soabã la a sẽn lebsd a mengã A Nengẽ, la a peegd lɩslaambã zãma n tʋg rẽ kosgo.",
          "Wilgda tẽeg-tɩrgã la tablg Wẽnd dĩinã zugu yellã sẽn ta zĩig ninga la ad yellã bilã yaa baas neerã.",
          "Yamb ka tõe n sek a meng baa nif kamsg pʋgẽ n yi tɩ Wẽnd tablg-a lɩslaangã zugã ye.",
          "Pirsdame tɩ b wʋsg doaag-kãngã, tɩ yaa Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) tikri.",
          "Paam n tablg lɩslaamdã zugã, yẽnda la neemã kãseng ning sẽn sõmb ne yamba t'a kẽn n bao-a la a pʋʋs a zu-Soab bark yell-kãngã zugu.",
        ],
