    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã saglame (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) tɩ b pek laok noor a yopoe, tɩ baag sã n tʋm a zelemdã a pʋgẽ, rẽenem pekrã tũuda ne tom, tɩ koomã yaool n wa, tɩ yɩlgemdã pidi, n yiis a rẽgdã la a sãangã.",
