    "title": "Baolleg (yεla) ka bak n be ne sɩd-kõta la sɩd-kõt paga, a mengẽ la a biigẽ, la a arzεkẽ, hal t'a wa tʋg n sεg Wẽnde, n ka tar zũnuub ye",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Hʋrayrat nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeelame: «Baolleg (yεla) ka bak n be ne sɩd-kõta la sɩd-kõt paga, a mengẽ la a biigẽ, la a arzεkẽ, hal t'a wa tʋg n sεg Wẽnde, n ka tar zũnuub ye».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã kõta kibare (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga): tɩ baolleg la zarb-n-gesg ka bak n be ne yamb sẽn yaa sɩd-kõt raoa la sɩd-kõt poaka, a mengẽ, a yĩng laafɩ wεεngẽ, la a koambẽ sẽn yaa bãag la kũum maa rogdb nɑmsgo, maa zẽng sẽn ka rẽnda, lɑ a arzεkẽ sẽn yaa talemdo la a tolb lʋɩɩse la zuubu, la a vɩɩm sẽn yaa toogo, la a rɩtl kaalem, halɩ tɩ Wẽnd tɩ yaaf a zũnuubã ne baolleg-kãngã la a tʋʋm-tuutsi, halɩ t'a wa tʋg n sεg Wẽnde, t'a lebga yɩlgemde n yi zũnuub la a yõsgr fãa a sẽn da maanã",
    "hints": [
