  3475: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "ned ning sẽn kõ a maam bas-m-yam ne bũmb ning sẽn be a ye-peed a yiibã sʋka la a nao a yiibã sʋka, m kõt-a-la bas-m-yam ne arzẽnã",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Sahl ɭbn Sa'ad nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) sẽn yi Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma - Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga- t'a yeelame: \" ned ning sẽn kõ a maam bas-m-yam ne bũmb ning sẽn be a ye-peed a yiibã sʋka la a nao a yiibã sʋka, m kõt-a-la bas-m-yam ne arzẽnã\".",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kõta kibar ne yεl a yiibu, lɩslaam sã n tablg-ba a kẽeda arzẽna,\n\nRẽenema: yaa zɩlemdã gũusgu n ra gom sẽn gẽed Wẽnd ye, A Naam zẽkame,\n\nYiib soɑbã: yɑɑ Tɑoorã gũusgʋ n dɑ kẽ yoob pʋgẽ ye;\n\nbɑlɑ yĩn-wil-kãensã b yiibã, wẽnd kɩɩsgã noor wʋsgo ɑ tũudɑ ne b yiibã.",
    "hints": [
