  },
  3476: {
    "category_id": 7,
    "category": "Nɑbiyɑɑmã vɩɩmã togsg lɑ kʋdmdã kibɑy",
    "title": "mam ra soodame, maam la Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) laok a yembr pʋgẽ, tɩ tõnd d yiibã fãa tar Gεnaabo, la a ra yɩɩme n sagend maam, tɩ mam sẽgne n sẽbe, t'a saagd maam tɩ mam tar Pekre",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAaɩša nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame: mam ra soodame, maam la Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) laok a yembr pʋgẽ, tɩ tõnd d yiibã fãa tar Gεnaabo, la a ra yɩɩme n sagend maam, tɩ mam sẽgne n sẽbe, t'a saagd maam tɩ mam tar Pekre, la a ra yiisda a zugã n kõt maam t'a bee miisrã pʋgẽ n maan ɭɩtɩkaafe, tɩ mam pekd a zugã, tɩ mam yaa Pekr soaba.",
    "explanation": "A ʿAaɩša -Muumin-rãmbã ma wã- kõta kibare (Wẽnd yarde be a yĩnga) yẽndã yell sãnda ne Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ), sẽn be rẽ pʋgẽ: yaa tɩ yẽ rag n sooda Gεnaab koom ne Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) laok a yembr pʋgẽ, tɩ bãmb b yiibã fãa toogd laokã pʋgẽ. La Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) a sã n rat yẽnda t'a yaa Pekr soaba, a sagend-a lame t'a lud a yĩngã, sẽn sɩng yũugẽ wã n tʋg n tãag rũmã t'a saagd-a, la ka yɩt kẽed-n-taar ye. la yaa tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) ra yɩɩme n maan ɭɩtɩkaaf miisrẽ wã, n yiisd a zugã n kõt a ʿAaɩša t'a pekdẽ, t'a ʿAaɩša be a roogẽ wã n yaa Pekr soaba.",
    "hints": [
          "Yaa tɩ sakdame tɩ rao la paga lagem taab n so laok a yembr pʋgẽ.",
          "Yaa tɩ sakdame tɩ b kẽ ne Hayd soaba, la ka yɩt taoorã ye, la a yĩngã sẽn ketã fãa yaa yɩlgemde.",
          "B bʋʋ nonglem tɩ b sẽgn n sẽbe kẽed-n-taarã wakato.",
          "Wilgdame tɩ b sõmb n rɩka sabab-rãmb nins sẽn na n gɩdg tɩ b ra lʋɩ haraamã pʋgẽ.",
          "Wilgdame tɩ gɩdgame tɩ Pekr soab wa kaoos miisr pʋga.",
          "Wilgame tɩ sakdame t'a sɩɩs yεlã, zem tɩ yaa maasr maa koεεnga, sẽn be rẽ pʋgẽ yaa zugã pekr la a sãasgo.",
          "Wilgda Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) sẽn tar tʋm-n-ta neere ne a zakã rãmba.",
        ],
