  3596: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "Allaahumma innii as'aluka al-hudaa, wa at-tuƙaa, wa al-ʿafaafa, wa al-ginaa= M Soab a Wẽnde, m kot-F-la kãndagre, la Wẽn-zoεεga, la yõk-f-menga, la sek-m-menga",
    "hadeeth": "Yi a ʿAbd Allaah ɭbn Masʿʋʋd nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), yii Nabiyaamã nengẽ, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) tɩ ad a rag n yɩɩme n yetẽ: «Allaahumma innii as'aluka al-hudaa, wa at-tuƙaa, wa al-ʿafaafa, wa al-ginaa= M Soab a Wẽnde, m kot-F-la kãndagre, la Wẽn-zoεεga, la yõk-f-menga, la sek-m-menga».",
    "explanation": "Rag n bee Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) kosgã pʋgẽ: \"Allaahumma innii as'aluka al-hudaa\" m Soab A Wẽnde, m kot-f-la kãndgre, sor sẽn yaa tɩrga, sẽn yaa sɩdã bãngre, la m tʋm ne-a \"wa at-tuƙaa\" la Wẽnd zoεεga, la m gãd saglsã la m zãag yel-gɩdgdsã \"wa al-ʿafaafa\" la m yõk m meng n yi bũmb ningã sẽn ka halaale, la ka be neere, sẽn yaa gomde, maa tʋʋmde \"wa al-ginaa\" la sek-m-menga n yi bõn-naandsã, n ka tar tʋlsẽm n tʋg ned baa a yembr, rẽnda Wẽnde (A Naam yɩ wagell n zẽke).",
    "hints": [
          "Wilgda yel-kãensã zɩslemã: kãndagre, Wẽnd zoεεga, la yõk-m-menga, la zẽk-m-menga, la sek-m-menga, a leb n pirsdame tɩ b zʋgl b mensã ne-ba.",
          "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) a ka so a mengã nafa maa namsg ye, la sẽn so-a rẽ wã, ad yaa Wẽnde, (A Naam zẽk yã).",
          "La Naab ning sẽn so-a namsgã la nangã, la kãndgrã ne bõn-naandsã yaa Wẽnd A Yembre, ka malεk sẽn pẽ Wẽnde, ka nabiyaama b sẽn tʋms tɩ yaa tẽn-tʋʋma, ka zẽng sẽn ka b yiibã.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A Muslim n togs-a",
  },
  3602: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "Mam yeelame, Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, d maanda a wãn n põse? T'a yeelae: « Yõk f zelemdã, pa f zakẽ wã la f kũm f zũnuubã",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿƲƙba ɭbn ʿAamir nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: Mam yeelame, Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, d maanda a wãn n põse? T'a yeelae: « Yõk f zelemdã, pa f zakẽ wã la f kũm f zũnuubã».",
    "explanation": "A ʿƲƙba ɭbn ʿAamir (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) soka Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) sabab-rãmb nins lɩslaam sẽn põsd dũni kaanẽ la laahr raarã.\n\nTɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) yeele: tablg yεl a tãabo:\n\nRẽenemã: gũus f zelemdã n yi bũmb ning fãa sẽn ka sõma, la wẽng fãa goama, la ra wa tʋg n gom ne f zelemdã rẽnda bũmb sẽn yaa sõma.\n\nYiib soaba: tablg f zakã n tũud Wẽnde, f sẽn wat n welg f yembre, la f maan soagla ne Wẽnd tũudmã, (A Naam yɩ wagell n zẽke) la f lak n be f zakẽ n yi fɩtna la dĩinã masɩɩbã.\n\nTãab soaba: kũm la f maan mims la f tuubi n leb Wẽnd nengẽ, n bas zũnuub-rãmb nins fo sẽn tʋmã.",
    "hints": [
          "Yaa Ṣahaabsã sẽn tar nong kεgenga (Wẽnd yard be b yĩnga) n na n bãng tɩlgrã soyã.",
          "A wilgda tɩlgrã soy sabab-rãmbã dũni la laahre.",
          "Wilgdame tɩ ninsaal maan soagl ne a menga, t'a sã n wa konge n ka tõe n naf a to, maa a yεεsdame tɩ nang n na n paam-a a dĩinẽ wã la a mengẽ wã, t'a sã n wa tʋg n gẽdg nebã.",
          "Hadiisã wilgdame tɩ b nigd pãnga ne zagsã, sẽn tʋg n yɩɩda yaa fɩtnã-rãmbã wakato, tɩ ad tablg zakã a bee soy nins sẽn rɩkd n paam n gũ dĩinã.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A At-tirmiiziy la a Ahmad n togs-a",
  },
  3636: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "Mam bee M yambã tẽ-sõng pʋga, M bee ne-a a sẽn wat n tẽegd Mam yʋʋrã",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Hʋrayrat nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã yeelame, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ): «Wẽnd yetame (A Naam zẽk yã): Mam bee M yambã tẽ-sõng pʋga, M bee ne-a a sẽn wat n tẽegd Mam yʋʋrã, rẽnd a sã n tẽeg Maam a mengẽ wã, M tẽegd-a-la M Mengẽ wã, a sã n tẽeg Maam zama pʋgẽ, Mam tẽegd-a-la zama pʋgẽ sõmblem sẽn yɩɩd zamã-kãngã, a sã n bao pẽnegr ne Maam nug-yakemde, Mam pẽnegd-a-la ne kãntɩɩga, la a sã n bao pẽnegr ne Maam ne kãntɩɩga, Mam baooda pẽnegr ne-a ne nug-loore, la a sã n wa Mam nengẽ t'a yaa sẽn kẽnde, M wata a nengẽ tɩ M yaa sẽn zãoosde».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã kõo kibare (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) tɩ Wẽnde (A Naam zẽk yã) a yetame:\n\nMam bee M yambã tẽ-sõngẽ ne Maam, rẽnd M tʋmda ne M yambã n zems ne yẽ sẽn tar tẽ-sõng ning ne Maamã, la rẽnda yaa sẽn tũ ne yẽnda sẽn tar tẽeb ne yel-sõmde la zũnuubã yaafa, M leb n maanda bũmb ning a sẽn tẽed Mam nengẽ sẽn yaa sõma la zẽng sẽn ka rẽ, Mam bee ne-a yolsgã la segl sõngã la kãndgrã la gũubã la sõngrã a sã n tẽeg Mam yelle.\n\nRẽnd a sã n tẽeg Mam yelle a nengẽ wã t'a yaa sẽn welg a toor n bak ne Sʋbhaanallaah la Laa'ɩlaaha ɭllallaah maaneg la zẽng sẽn ka yɩ rẽnda, Mam tẽegd-a-la Mam nengẽ.\n\nLa a sã n tẽeg Mam yell zama sʋka, Mam tẽegda a yell zama waooglem la a sõmblem sẽn yɩɩd zama-kãnga.\n\nLa ned ning sẽn pẽnega Wẽnd sẽn zems nug-yakemde, Wẽnd paasd-a lame t'a paam pẽnegr ne Wẽnd ne kãntɩɩga.\n\nLa ned ning sẽn bao pẽnegr ne Wẽnd t'a woglem ta kanga, Wẽnd pẽnegd-a lame t'a ta nug-yakemde.\n\nLa a sã n wa Wẽnd nengẽ t'a yaa sẽn kẽnde, Wẽnd wata a nengẽ ne yãgengo.\n\nRẽnd yamb sã n bao pẽnegr ne a Soabã ne tũudmã la toaglã, a Soabã paasd-a-la pẽnegre, tɩ yaa sẽn na n rol-a ne tʋʋmdã buudu.\n\nRẽnd muumin tũudmã sẽn pid fãa ne a Soabã, a pẽnegda Wẽnde (A Naam zẽk yã) Wẽnd kũunã la a yel-sõmã rolbo, a yɩɩda yambã tʋʋmã la a nongã, la raabã yaa tɩ Wẽnd keoorã a wila yambã tʋʋma, zem tɩ yaa a sõmblemã la a waooglemã.\n\nRẽnd muumin a manegda a tẽebo la a tʋmdẽ la a yãgdẽ la a paasd a tʋʋmã halɩ t'a wa tʋg n yek Wẽnde.",
    "hints": [
          "Hadiis-kãngã bee hadiis-rãmb nins Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) sẽn togsde, tɩ yaa sẽn yi a Soabã nengẽ, b boond-a lame tɩ hadiis Ƙudsy (hadiis yɩlenga) maa hadiis ɭlaahy (Wẽnd hadiisi) yẽ me la hadiis ninga, a gom-biisã la a maanã wã yii Wẽnd nengẽ, la mikame t'a ka tar Alkʋrãanã sẽn tar yεl ninsã ye, b sẽn tũud Wẽnd ne a karengã, la yɩlgd a yĩnga la a leb n geesdẽ la a komsd nebã tɩ b ka tõe n wa ne a buudu la zẽng sẽn ka rẽndã, hadiis ƙudsy wã ka tar rẽ ye.",
          "A Al-Gʋrri (Wẽnd na yols-a) a yeelame: sɩdã rãmbã b sɩfda Wẽnde, ne bũmb ninga A sẽn sɩf A Mengã (A Naam zẽk yã), la ne bũmb ninga Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋm sẽn sɩf ne-A wã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) la Ṣahaabsã sẽn sɩf ne-A bũmb ninga (Wẽnd yard be b yĩnga) la wãnde la bãngdbã na-kẽndre, sẽn yaa neb nins sẽn pʋg vũunã n ka maan Bid'ah n sɩng yεlã. gomdã sεεme. Rẽnd Sunnah rãmba tabenda ne Wẽnde bũmb ninga A sẽn tabend A Menga, yʋy la sɩf-rãmba, tɩ ka tũ ne wẽnebo, ka tũ ne basbo, ka tũ ne bao n bãng b yalε wã, ka rɩkda n wõnesd ne bõn-naandse, la b tusd n zãagdẽ, Wẽnd sẽn tus n zãag A Mengã, la b sĩndid n basd yεl nins b sẽn ka gɩdg la b ka saglã, Wẽnd yeelame (A Naam zẽk yã): (Bũmb pa be n wõnd-A ye, la Yẽnda la a Wʋmd n yaa Neta).",
          "Maneg tẽebã ne Wẽndã, yaa tɩlae tɩ tʋʋm lageme, a Al-hasan Al-basriy yeelame (Wẽnd na yols-a): ad muumin sã n maneg a tẽebã ne a Soabã la a maneg a tʋʋmdã, A manegda a tʋʋmdã. La ad nin-wẽnga, a wẽnga a tẽebã ne Wẽnde, rẽ n kɩt t'a maand tʋʋm wẽnse.",
          "Limaam Al-ƙurtubiy yeelame (Wẽnd na yols-a): b yeelame: \"Mam yambã tẽ-sõngã ne Maamã\" a võore, yaa a sẽn tẽed tɩ b reeg a doaagã kosgã sasa, la a sẽn tẽed tɩ b na n reega a tuubgu tuubgã sasa, la zũnuubã yaafg yaafgã sasa, la yel-sõmd rolbo tũudmã sẽn wat n maan ne b sart-rãmba, yaa a sẽn gãd Wẽnd pʋlengã sɩda, rẽ n kɩt tɩ sõmba ne ned t'a nidg pãnga ne yẽ sẽn be bũmb ning zugã, n maan bãng-n-wãaka tɩ Wẽnd na n reegame, A na n yaafame, bala Wẽnd pʋlma rẽnda, Wẽnd pʋlengã ka yidgdi, a sã n loe maa a tẽedame t'a tũudmã ka na n reege, a tũudmã ka nefd ye, yaa woto la wãag f tẽeb ne Wẽnd yolsgã, yẽ me bee zũnuub bεdã pʋse, ned ning sẽn wa n ki ne yel-kãngã b kelled n bas-a-la ne bũmb ninga a sẽn da tẽedã, la sẽn be hadiisã soyã sãnda pʋgẽ: \"bɩ mam yambã tẽ Maam tẽeb ninga a sẽn tʋlle\", a yeelame: sã n yaa yaafgã tẽ-sõngã n lagem ne ket n be zũnuubã pʋgẽ wã, ad rẽnda yaa zɩɩlem la belg-m-meng tεkẽ.",
          "Hadiisã kengdame tɩ b nidg pãng ne Wẽnd yʋʋrã tẽegre, f mengẽ wã la f zelemdã fãa, f mengẽ wã la f sũurẽ wã, n yεεsd Wẽnde, la f tẽegd A zɩslemã la A hakε wã, la f tall tẽeb ne-A la f zɩsgd-A la f nong-A, la f maan tẽ-sõng ne Wẽnde, la f yɩlg f tʋʋmdã Wẽnd yĩnga, la f yeel ne f zelemdã: Sʋbhɑɑnɑ Allɑɑh, wa Al-hamdu lillaah, wa laa ɩlaaha ɩlla Allaah, wa Allaahʋ Akbar, wa laahawla walaa ƙuwwata illaa billaah.",
          "A ɭbn Abɩɩ Gamra yeelame (Wẽnd na yols-a): ned ning sẽn tẽega Wẽnd t'a yaa yεεsda, A kõt-a-la bas-m-yam, a sã n yaa nen-soabg soaba, A kõt-a-la nen-yubsgu.",
          "Nug-yakemdã: yaa bũmb ning sẽn be nug-bi-kεmlgẽ wã ne nug-raoogã sʋka tɩ f sã n yaag f nugã, la kangã: yaa bũmb ning sẽn be nu-bi tẽng-n-sʋgr zugu n tʋg n tãag kãntɩɩgã kõbre, la kãntɩɩga yaa Adam biig kams a yiibã yalem la a kam-lulsã la a yãoogã yalem; la yẽnda yaa kams a naase.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "B zemsa taab a zugu (A Al-Bʋẖaariy la a Muslim n reeg-a)",
  },
