    "hadeeth": "Yii a Sʋrayh ɭbn Haaniy nengẽ, a yeelame: Mam soka a Aaɩša n yeele: yaa ne bõe la Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) ra sɩngd ne t'a sã n wa kẽ a zakẽ wã? La a yeel yã: yaa ne sɩgdre.",
    "explanation": "Rag n bee Nabiyaamã kãndagrã pʋgẽ, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) t'a sɩngda ne sɩgdre a sã n wa kẽ a zakẽ wã, sẽn yaa wakat ning fãa, zem tɩ yaa yʋngo maa wĩndgã.",
