          "Wilgda Taabɩ'ɩɩna-rãmbã (Ṣahaabsã pʋgdbã) sẽn tar yã-beed ne Nabiyaamã yεlã sok-n-bãnge, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) la a Sũnn-rãmbã, sẽn na yɩl n tik-a.",
