    "title": "Bũmb ka paamd lɩslaamã sẽn yaa yaamse, la bãase, la yɩɩgre, la sũ-sãanga, la nango, la pakre, halɩ n tʋg n tãag gõaag sẽn kõsd-a, rẽndame tɩ Wẽnd yaaf a tʋʋm tuuti wã ne rẽ sabɑbo",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Sa’ɩɩd Al-Hʋdry nengẽ la Abɩɩ Hʋrayrat nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga) tɩ yii Nabiyaamã nengẽ (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) a yeelame-: «Bũmb ka paamd lɩslaamã sẽn yaa yaamse, la bãase, la yɩɩgre, la sũ-sãanga, la nango, la pakre, halɩ n tʋg n tãag gõaag sẽn kõsd-a, rẽndame tɩ Wẽnd yaaf a tʋʋm tuuti wã ne rẽ sabɑbo».",
    "explanation": "Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) vẽnegdame n wilgdẽ, tɩ bũmb ning sẽn paamd sẽn yaa bãase la yɩɩre, la sũ-sãamse, la keelem, la masɩɩb-rãmba, la yel-kegemse, la pelεn-yɩka la kom - baa tɩ sã n yɑɑ gõaag n kõs-a tɩ zabdẽ- rẽnda yɩtɑ a zũnuubã yaafgo.",
    "hints": [
