  3711: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "Raar sõmblem, wĩndgã sẽn puk a zugu, yaa arzũm raare",
    "hadeeth": "Yii ɑ Abɩɩ Hʋrɑyrɑt nengẽ (Wẽnd yɑrd be ɑ yĩngɑ) ɑ yeelɑme: tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeelame: «Raar sõmblem, wĩndgã sẽn puk a zugu, yaa arzũm raare, a pʋgẽ la b naan a Ādema, a pʋgẽ la b kẽes-a arzãna, a pʋgẽ la b yiis-a arzãnẽ wã, la dũni pa yikdi rẽnda arzũm raare».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) kõta kibare, tɩ raar wĩndg sẽn pukd ɑ pʋgẽ sõma sẽn tʋg n yɩɩde, yaa arzũma, la sẽn tʋg n be arzũm raar yεl-weendɩ wã: yaa tɩ Wẽnd naana a Ādem a pʋgẽ, (tɩlgr be a yĩnga) la yẽ pʋgẽ me la A kẽes-a arzãnã, arzũm raar me la A yiis-a arzãnẽ wã, n sik-a Tẽng gãngã zugu, la dũni wã me ka na n yiki, rẽnda arzũm reare.",
    "hints": [
          "Wilgda arzũmã sẽn yɩɩd rasem a yopoe wã raar-rãmbã.",
          "Yaa sẽn pirsd tɩ b nidg pãng ne tʋʋm-sõms arzũm raare, la b segl sẽn na paam Wẽnd yolsgã (A Naam yɩ wagelle) la tus A namsgã n yi f menga.",
          "Yel-weendɩ-kãensã arzũmã raar sẽn tarã, b sẽn togs hadiisã pʋgẽ wã, b yeelame: tɩ ka sẽn n wilgd arzũmã raar yɩɩdlem ye, bala a Ādem arzãnã yiisgu, la dũni wã yikri, b ka bũmb sẽn sõt tɩ yaa yɩɩdlem ye, tɩ sãnda yeel tɩ ad a gillã fãa yaa yɩɩdlem, la a Ādem arzãnã yiibã a sababã yaa koambã sẽn na n zĩndã, sẽn yaa tẽn-tʋʋmba, la nabiyaam-rãmba, la nin-sõmsã, la sã n yɑɑ dũni wã yikrã, a yaa sabab sẽn na n yãg ne nin-sõmsã keoorã, la b leb n paam bũmb ning Wẽnd sẽn sεgl n bĩng-ba, tɩ yaa waoogrã.",
          "B togsa yel-weendɩ a taaba sẽn be arzũmã rɑɑre, tɩ ka togs-kãngã pʋgẽ wã ye, la sẽn be a pʋgẽ: tɩ yaa arzũm raar la b reeg a Ādem tuubgu, leb n yaa arzũm raar me la b reeg a yõorã, la wakat n be arzũm rɑɑrã, tɩ yamb sẽn yaa sɩd-kõt ka tukd-a, n mik tɩ yẽ pʋʋsdame, tɩ yaa Wẽnd la a kota, rẽndɑme tɩ Wẽnd kõ-a bũmbã.",
          "Yʋʋmdã rasẽm-rãmb sõmblem sẽn yɩɩde, yaa Arafa raare, tɩ sãnda yeele: yaa kibsã raare, la rasem a yopoe wã sõmblem sẽn yɩɩd yaa arzũm raare, la yʋndã sẽn yɩɩd yaa Laylatʋ Al-ƙadr (kordgã yʋngã).",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A Muslim n togs-a",
  },
  3714: {
