          "A ɭbn Hagar (Wẽnd na yols-a) a yeelame: a sẽn yeelã: (a ka yik n pʋʋse) sẽn yaa Pʋʋsg ning fãa, toẽeme tɩ yaa Pʋʋsg sẽn yãk toore, la sẽn ratã yaa yʋngã maa faril-rãmbã Pʋʋsgo.",
