    "hadeeth": "Yii Abʋʋ Hʋrɑyrɑt nengẽ (Wẽnd yɑrd be ɑ yĩng) ɑ yeelɑme: mɑm wʋmɑ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmɑ (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) t'ɑ yetẽ: «Mam poorẽ rãmbã fãa yaa sẽn yɑɑf-b rãmbɑ, sã n ka vẽnegdbã, la sẽn be vẽnegrã pʋgẽ, yaa ned sẽn na n maan tʋʋm yʋngo, n vẽeg beoog tɩ Wẽnd luda a bãngo, t'a tʋg n yetẽ: zagla! Ad yʋngẽ mam maana woto la woto, ad yẽ rag n gãanda yʋngẽ t'a Soabã yaa sẽn lud a bãngo, t'a vẽeg beoong n pãrgd Wẽnd sʋtrã (bãn-loeerã) n basd a mengã».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) vẽnegdame n wilgdẽ tɩ lɩslaam sẽn yaa zũnuub soaba, a tẽeda Wẽnd yolsgã la A yaafgã a yĩnga, sã n ka ned ning sẽn wa n vẽnegda Wẽnd kɩɩsgã, n pugd ne-a la yaa yalamdo, yẽ soab ka sõmb ne yaafa ye, ne a sẽn na n maan Wẽnd kɩɩsg yʋngo, n vẽeg beoog tɩ Wẽnd yaa sẽn lud a bãngo, t'a tʋg n yẽsd ne nin-zẽnga tɩ yẽ maana Wẽnd kɩɩs-kãngã zaame, tɩ Wẽnd yaool n da luda yẽ bãongo, tɩ yẽnda vẽeg beoog n pãrgd Wẽnd bãongã n basd a meng ne yãnde!!",
    "hints": [
