    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abdʋllaah ɭbn Amr nengẽ, -Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga-, tɩ yii Nabiyaamã nengẽ, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) a yeelame: «Ad rog tõkdɑ pɑ sẽn mɑɑndɑ neere n rondẽ wã ye, lɑ ɑd rog tõkdɑ yɑɑ b sẽn nɑ n wãɑg ɑ soɑb rogem, lɑ a sẽn tõkd-ɑ».",
