    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abʋʋ Hʋrayrat nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) a yeelame-: «Zoambd n ningd sẽn kẽnda sallem, tɩ sẽn kẽndɑ n ningd zĩid sallem, tɩ neb kɩdg ning neb wʋsg sallem». la bee Al-bʋhaarɩ pʋgẽ: «bi-bilf n ningd kasem sallem, tɩ pɩʋʋgd ning zĩid sallem, tɩ neb bilf ning neb wʋsg sallem».",
