  4436: {
    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "Fighu wã ne Yẽgã",
    "title": "Ned ning sẽn loe noor rɑɑr ɑ ye tɩ yẽ be Wẽnd sorã sõngr pʋgẽ, Wẽnd na n zãaga a nengã ne Bugmã bõn-bɩʋʋng pis-yopoe",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Saʿɩɩd Al-ẖʋdriy nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame: mam wʋma Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), t’a yetẽ: «Ned ning sẽn loe noor rɑɑr ɑ ye tɩ yẽ be Wẽnd sorã sõngr pʋgẽ, Wẽnd na n zãaga a nengã ne Bugmã bõn-bɩʋʋng pis-yopoe».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã vẽnegame n wilgdẽ (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la a tɩlg be a yĩnga) tɩ ned ning sẽn loe noor gɩhaadɩ raare, la sãnda yeelame tɩ gɩhaadɩ raare la zẽng sẽn ka gɩhaadɩ raare, tɩ yaa pʋ-peelem maaneg ne Wẽnde, n baood yel-sõmd laahr raarã Wẽnd nengẽ, tɩ ad Wẽnd ne a yɩɩdlemã, A zãagd-a-lɑ ne Bugmã bõn-bɩʋʋng pis-yopoe.",
    "hints": [
          "Limaam An-nawawiy yeelame (Wẽnd na yols-a): loe noor Wẽnd yĩngã, a yaa bũmb sẽn wilgd tɩ yaa ned ning noorã loees sẽn ka namsd-a, hakε ka na n põse sẽn tũ ne no-loeerã, tɩ zabrã me ka na n keoos ne a sabab ye, bũmb baa a yembr sẽn yaa zabrã yεl ka na n keoos ye.",
          "A pirsdame la a wilgd yamleoog maaneg ne naafɩlã no-loeere.",
          "Wilgda sẽn yaa tɩlae tɩ b maan pʋ-peelem la b bao Wẽnd yardo la b ra tʋg n loet noor tɩ yaa maan-tɩ-b-wʋme, ka bõn-raab zẽng me ye.",
          "A As-Sindy yeelame (Wẽnd na yols-a): a sẽn yeel tɩ (Wẽnd yĩnga) tõeeme tɩ raabã yaa Anniy wã manegr bala, la tõeeme tɩ raabã me a loeeme n mik t'a bee gɩhaadɩ zĩigẽ, la yaa yiib soab-kãngã la sẽn wat ned fãa yamẽ wã.",
