    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã kõo kibare (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) tɩ nebã ka bak n be sõma pʋgẽ, tɩ b sã n yãg ne noorã kaoobo, b sẽn paam hakɩɩk tɩ wĩndgã lʋɩɩme poorẽ, la rẽnda yaa Sũnnah gãdbo la a todsã zug yalsgo.",
    "hints": [
          "A An-nawawiy yeelame (Wẽnd na yols-a): be a pʋgẽ sẽn yaa pirsg tɩ b yãg ne no-kaoorã tɩ b sã n paam hakɩɩk tɩ wĩndgã lʋɩɩme, la a võorã rat n yeelame tɩ nebã yell ka bake n yaa sẽn tũnugd taaba b sã n ket n gũusd sũnn-kãngã, la b sã n wa yaoolge, yẽ me yaa tagmas n wilgd sãang bãmb sẽn lʋɩt a pʋgẽ.",
