          "Yõsg Gafã rãmbã la bidah wã rãmbã, bala bãmb yaoonda no-kaoorã.",
          "A ɭbn Hagar yeelame (Wẽnd na yols-a): La be a pʋgẽ b sẽn vẽneg sababã, a Al-Muhallab yeelame: la sẽn yeel rẽ wã, sõmã ning sẽn be a pʋgẽ, yaa sẽn na yɩl tɩ wĩndgã ra wa paas n yɩɩg yʋngã, rẽ n yɩɩd bʋg-bʋg ne no-loεta n leb n kõt-a pãng ne tũudmã n yɩɩda, la bãngdbã zemsa taaba tɩ ad zĩ-kãngã wã yaa sẽn na n mik t'a tara bas-m-yam ne wĩndgã lʋɩɩse, n tũ ne gesgo maa tẽeg-tɩrg rãmb b yiib n togs tɩ wĩndgã lʋɩɩme, la woto bala, baa tɩ yaa nin-yεng sẽn yaa tẽeg-tɩrg soab n kõ kibarã tɩ wĩndgã lʋɩɩme, gomd sẽn tʋg n wil n yɩɩda.",
          "A ɭbn Hagar yeelame (Wẽnd na yols-a): Nekre: sẽn be bidah-rãmb nins b sẽn kisgã pʋgẽ, yaa bũmb ning sẽn yẽbg tõnd zamaanã pʋgẽ ne b sẽn boond fagirã laandãan a yiib n soɑbã taoore tɩ fɑgirã nɑ n pɑ tɑ n zems wala minit pisi Ramadaanã pʋgẽ, la b sẽn kiisd lampɑ-rãmbã b sẽn mɑɑn tɩ yɑɑ tɑgmɑs n wilgd rɩɩbã la yũubã gɩdgre ne ned ning sẽn rata noorã loeese, tɩ neb nins sẽn maand-a wã yẽgemdẽ tɩ woto n yɩɩd ne a na gũbg tũudmã pʋgẽ, la ned ka mi rẽnda sã n ka neb bilfu, la yel-kãng tak-b lame tɩ b ka leb n boond laandãanã sã n ka wĩndgã lʋɩɩs poor bilfu, sẽn na yɩl tɩ wakatã paam n kẽ sõma, woto la b yẽgemda, tɩ yɩ sabab tɩ b yaoolg no-kaoorã la b yãg ne sugrã rɩɩbo, n yõsg Nabiyaamã sũnnah, rẽ n kɩt tɩ sõmã wã boog b nengẽ, tɩ b wẽngã wʋsge. La Wẽnd la d kot sõngre.",
