    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "Fighu wã ne Yẽgã",
    "title": "La Wẽnd ka kõ yãmb bũmb ning y sẽn tõe n maan sara ne laa? Ad sʋbhaanallaah fãa yaa sara, la Allaahʋ akbarʋ fãa yaa sara, la Alhamdʋ lillaah yaa sara, la laa'ɩlaaha ɭllallaah yaa sara, sagl ne manegr yaa sara, gɩdg ned n yi yel-kiti yaa sara, yãmb yembr fãa kẽed-n-taar ne a paga yaa sara",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Zarr nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga): Tɩ neb sẽn yi Nabiyaamã Ṣahaabsẽ wã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), yeela Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga): Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã: ad arzεgsã rãmb looga ne keoorã zãnga, b pʋʋsda wala tõnd sẽn pʋʋsdã la b loe noor wala tõnd sẽn loetã, la b leb n maand sara ne b arzεgsã sẽn kellã, t'a yeele:«La Wẽnd ka kõ yãmb bũmb ning y sẽn tõe n maan sara ne laa? Ad sʋbhaanallaah fãa yaa sara, la Allaahʋ akbarʋ fãa yaa sara, la Alhamdʋ lillaah yaa sara, la laa'ɩlaaha ɭllallaah yaa sara, sagl ne manegr yaa sara, gɩdg ned n yi yel-kiti yaa sara, yãmb yembr fãa kẽed-n-taar ne a paga yaa sara». La b yeel yã Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã, rẽ yĩnga tõnd yembr fãa na n wa n bao a yõor yamleoog ne a paga la a leb n tall keoore? T'a yeele: «Yãmb ka ne t'a sã n rag ning-a haraamã pʋgẽ, a na n talla zũnuub laa? Yaa woto bala, a sã n rɩk-a n ning halaalẽ wã me a tara keoore».",
    "explanation": "Ṣahaabsã tals sãnda, b togsa b halhaalã la b talemdã Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), la bãmb sẽn ka tar arzεgs sẽn na n maan doose, sẽn na yɩl n paam yel-sõm-wʋsgo wala bãmb ma-biis sẽn yaa ligdã rãmb sẽn paam n maanã, tɩ bãmb me paam sõma wala bãmb sẽn maanã, bala b pʋʋsda wala bãmb sẽn pʋʋsdã la b loet noor  wala bãmb sẽn loetã, la b leb n rɩkd b arzεg kεlã b maan sara-rãmba, tɩ tõnd ka tar sẽn maand ye! Tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) wilgd-b bãmb me sẽn tõe maane, sẽn yaa sara-rãmba, tɩ Nabiyaamã yeele (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga): Rẽ yĩnga Wẽnd ka maan n kõ yãmb bũmb ning y sẽn maan sara y mensẽ wã?! Ad yãmb sẽn na n yeel: Sʋbhaana-llaah) Yɩlgr be ne Wẽnde, yãmb paamda sara yel-sõmde, yaa woto bal la (Allaahʋ Akbar) Wẽnd n yɩɩd ne bedrem yeelgo yaa sara (Al-hamdʋ Lɩllaah) Pẽgr be ne Wẽnde, yaa sara, la (Laa'ɩlaaha ɩllallaah) lɑ soab ka be tɩ sã n ka Wẽnde, yaa sara, sagl ne sẽn sõmb yaa sara, la gɩdg yel-kiti yaa sara, hal n tʋg n tãag yãmb ned fãa kẽed-n-taar ne a paga yaa sara. Tɩ b maan yel-solemd la b yeele: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã, tõnd ned fãa na n wa maana a yõor yamleoogo n leb n tar keoore?! T'a yeele: rẽ yĩnga yãmb ka mi t'a sã n ning-a haraam pʋgẽ sẽn yaa yoob la zẽng sẽn ka rẽ, a ka tar zũnuub laa? Woto bala a sã n ning-a halaal pʋgẽ a tara yel-sõmde.",
    "hints": [
          "Wilgda Ṣahaabsã sẽn põsd taab ne tʋʋm sõms maanego la b nong-kεgeng la yã-beed sẽn paam yel-sõm-bεda la kũun sẽn yi Wẽnd nengẽ (A Naam zẽk yã).",
          "Wilgda tʋʋm sõmsã nems sẽn yaa wʋsgo la b gũbga tʋʋm buud fãa lɩslaam sẽn yik n yals ne-a, n lagem ne Anniy sõng la raab sõngo.",
          "Wilgda lɩslaangã yol-yolã la a naanã wã, rẽnd lɩslaam fãa paanda bũmb ning sẽn tõe n maan n tũ Wẽnde ne bũmb-kãngã.",
          "A An-Nawawiy yeelame (Wẽnd na yols-a): la daliil bee yãwã pʋgẽ tɩ ad yεl nins sẽn ka tũudmã b tõe n lebga tũudum ne Anniy-rãmb sẽn sɩdge, rẽnd kẽed-n-taarã yɩta tũudum t'a sã n maan Anniy wã tɩ yaa pag hakε la a rat n na n kõ, la a leb n vɩɩms ne-a vɩɩs-n-taar sẽn yaa neere wala Wẽnd saglã (A Naam zẽk yã) maa yaa bi-sõng baoobo, maa yaa a mengã la a rat n na n sek la a sek a paga, la a gɩdg b yiibã fãa tɩ b ra ges haraam, maa b tags a pʋgẽ maa b maan yɩɩgr ne-a, maa zẽng sẽn ka rẽnda, sẽn yaa sõma.",
          "Wilgda bilg-n-taar la makr rɩkr bʋɩl yĩng tɩ yell ning sẽn ratã yɩ vẽenega, n leb n wʋmd tʋbrẽ n yɩɩda.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A Muslim n togs-a",
  },
  4559: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "Ad bũmb ninga nebã sẽn mikã, sẽn yaa nabiyaamdemã goam kʋdgã: \"f sã n ka zoet yãnde, bɩ f maan f sẽn rate!",
    "hadeeth": "Yii ɑ Abɩɩ Mɑs'ʿʋʋd nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) ɑ yeelɑme: Nɑbiyɑɑmã yeelɑme (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga): «Ad bũmb ninga nebã sẽn mikã, sẽn yaa nabiyaamdemã goam kʋdgã: \"f sã n ka zoet yãnde, bɩ f maan f sẽn rate!\"».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã kõo kibare (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) tɩ ad bũmb ninga sẽn wa rẽenem nabiyaam-rãmbã saglg pʋgẽ, tɩ nebã taas-a bãmb ne taab sʋka, tɩ zama wʋsg reeg a kibayã, yʋʋm kobs kobs poorẽ, halɩ t'a wa tʋg n ta Zãmã-kãngã rẽenem rãmba: ges fo sẽn rat n maan bũmb ningã, sã n mik tɩ yãnd ka be a pʋgẽ, bɩ f maan-a, la sã n mikame tɩ yãnd be a pʋgẽ bɩ f bas-a. La ad bũmb ning sẽn gɩdgd wẽng tʋʋmde yaa yãn-zoεεga, rẽnd ned ning sẽn ka zoeta yãnde, a bõrda a mengã yel-wẽng la yel-kiti maaneg pʋgẽ.",
    "hints": [
          "Wilgdame tɩ yãn-zoεεga a yaa zʋg-wagell yẽgre.",
          "Yãn-zoεεg yaa sɩf sẽn yi nabiyaam-rãmbã sɩf-rãmbẽ, a yaa bũmb b sẽn mik b nengẽ.",
          "Yaa yãn-zoeerã n kɩt tɩ ned sẽn yaa lɩslaam maan neere, la a basd rẽgd la paoor tʋʋmde.",
          "A An-Nawawy yeelame: bee saglgã pʋgẽ sor kũuni, rat n yeele: f sã n rat n maan yelle, a sã n yɩɩme tɩ fo ka zoet a yãnd Wẽnd nengẽ la nebã nengẽ, bɩ f maan-a, sã n ka rẽ bɩ f ra maan ye, la yaa yãwã la lɩslaamdã gilgda, la woto teesgo yaa tɩ bũmb ninga b sẽn sagl tɩ yaa waagibã (tɩlae wã) la b sẽn bʋ nonglem a maanegã b zoeta yãnd ne b basgo. La bũmb ninga b sẽn gɩdgã, sẽn yaa haraamã la b sẽn kisgã  b zoeta yãnd ne b maanego, la sã n yaa yεl nins b sẽn pa gɩdg tɩ b maan-a wã zoe yãnd n pa maan-a wã sakdame, a basba me sεgdame. Tɩ hadiisã gũbg Bʋʋd a nu wã, la sãnda yeelame: yaa bugsg saglga, la a maanã wã: b sã n võog yãnd n yi foom bɩ f maan f sẽn rate, tɩ ad Wẽnd na n yaoo foom a zugu. Tɩ sãnda yeele:  T'a yaa saglg t'a maanã wã yaa kibar togsgo, rat n na n yeele:  ned ning sẽn ka zoeta yãnde a maanda a sẽn rate.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A Al-Bʋẖaariy n togs-a",
  },
  4560: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "Ad tʋʋmã yaa ne Anniy-rãmbã, la ninsaal fãa yaa a sẽn maan Anniy ningã n be ne-a",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Ʋmar ɭbn Al-hattaab nengẽ - Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga-: a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeeleme: «Ad tʋʋmã tũudɑ ne Anniya-rãmbã, lɑ ɑd ned fãɑ sẽn dɩk Anniy ningã n be ne-ɑ, rẽnd ned ning sẽn maana Higra (yik Mɑk n kẽng Mɑdiinã) tɩ yɑɑ Wẽnd lɑ A Tẽn-tʋʋmã yĩngɑ, rẽnd yẽ soɑb Yikrã yɩtɑ Wẽnd lɑ A Tẽn-tʋʋmɑ yĩngɑ, lɑ ned ning Yikrã sẽn wɑ n yɑɑ dũni yĩnga n rɑt n nɑ n pɑɑm-ɑ, mɑɑ yɑɑ pɑgɑ lɑ a rɑt n furi, rẽnd yẽ yikrã yɑɑ ɑ sẽn yik n kẽng bũmb ning yĩngã». La gom-bila a yembr n be Albʋhaary pʋga: « Ad tʋʋmã yaa ne Anniy-rãmbã, la ninsaal fãa yaa a sẽn maan Anniy ningã n be ne-a».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) vẽnegdame n wilgdẽ, tɩ tʋʋmã fãa yaa b sẽn get Anniy wã, la bʋ-kãngã yaa bũmb sẽn gũbg tʋʋmã fãa gill pʋgẽ, sẽn yaa tũudum yεla la tʋmd-n-taare, rẽnd ned ning sẽn wa n rɩka a tʋʋmã tɩ yaa nafa la a rata, a ka na n paame rẽnda nafã-kãngã bala, a ka tar yel-sõmde, la ned ning sẽn wa n rɩka a tʋʋmdã tɩ yaa Wẽnd la a rat n na n pẽnege, a paamda yel-sõmd a tʋʋmdẽ wã la rolbo, baa tɩ mikame tɩ yaa tʋʋm zaala, wala yũub la rɩɩbo.\n\nRẽ poorẽ tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) rɩk bilgri, n na n wilg Anniy wã vũun sẽn ta to-to ningã tʋʋmẽ wã, n lagem ne fãa zemsa taab yĩngr-yĩngrã, rẽnda a wilga ned ning sẽn wa n rɩka Anniy ne Yikrã la tẽngã basgo tɩ yaa Wẽnd yardã baoobo, rẽnd yẽ soab yikrã yaa yikr sari wã sẽn rate, tɩ yaa b sẽn reege, t'a na n paam yel-sõmdã a Anniyã sɩdgrã yĩngã, la ned ning sẽn wa n rɩka a yikrã tɩ yaa dũni nafa raab la arzεka la lohorem maa tolbo maa paga, rẽnd a ka na n paam a yikrã pʋgẽ sã n ka nafã-kãngã bala, a sẽn maana Anniy wã ne bũmb ningã, la a ka na n paam yel-sõma la rolbã ye.",
    "hints": [
          "Hadiisã kengdame tɩ b yals ne Wẽnd yembgo, bala Wẽnd ka reegd tʋʋmde, sã n ka tʋʋm ninga b sẽn bao a pʋgẽ Wẽnd yardã ye.",
          "Tʋʋm nins sẽn tar n pẽnegd ne Wẽndã, A Naam yɩ wagell n zẽke, ninsaal sã n tʋm-a tɩ yaa wala yel-minimdsã a ka tar nafa a zug ye, halɩ t'a wa tʋg n maan a Anniy wã tɩ yaa yel-sõmd la a rata.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "B zemsa taab a zugu (A Al-Bʋẖaariy la a Muslim n reeg-a)",
  },
  4563: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "lɩslaangã yaa f maan kaset tɩ soab sẽn na n tũ n tɩlg ka be rẽnda Wẽnde, la a Mʋhammad yaa Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, la f yals ne Pʋʋsgo la f yãk Zaka n kõ, la f loe Ramadaane, la f kaag Roogã tɩ f sã n paam sor n na n tʋg beenẽ",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Ʋmar ɭbn Al-hattaab nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame: Raar a yembr tõnd sẽn da zĩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋm nengẽ, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), la raoa sẽn puk tõnd nengẽ, t'a futã peelem yaa wʋsgo, t'a zugã zoobd sablem yaa wʋsgo, b ka ne sor vũun a zug ye, ned baa a yembr me ka mi-a tõnd pʋgẽ, halɩ t'a wa tʋg n zĩnd Nabiyaama nengẽ, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), n tik a rũm a yiibã n teeg Nabiyaamã rũmã, n rɩk a nus tal a yiibã n rogl a gε a yiibã zugu, n yeele: « Mʋhammade, wilg maam lɩslaang sẽn yaa a soaba, t'a yeele: « tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, -Wẽnd pʋʋsg la a tɩlgr be a yĩnga-, yeele: «  lɩslaangã yaa f maan kaset tɩ soab sẽn na n tũ n tɩlg ka be rẽnda Wẽnde, la a Mʋhammad yaa Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, la f yals ne Pʋʋsgo la f yãk Zaka n kõ, la f loe Ramadaane, la f kaag Roogã tɩ f sã n paam sor n na n tʋg beenẽ». La a yeele: « f togs sɩda». T'a Ʋmar yeele: «tɩ tõnd maan yel-solemd ne-a, a sẽn sokd Nabiyaamã la a leb n sɩdgd-a wã». La raoã yeele: « bɩ f kõ maam kibare sɩd-kũun sẽn yaa a soaba»,Tɩ Nabiyaamã yeele: « yaa f kõ sɩd ne Wẽnde, la A malεgsã la A Gaf-rãmbã la A Tẽn-tʋʋmbã la Yaoolem Raarã, la f kõ sɩd ne Pʋlengã, a wẽnga la a sõma». La a yeele: « f togsa sɩda». T'a yeele: « bɩ f togs maam manegre». La a yeele: «yaa fo tũ Wẽnde, tɩ yaa wala fo ne-A lame, bala fo sã n yɩ n ka ne-A, ad A ne-f lame». T'ɑ yeele: «bɩ f togs mɑɑm dũni yikr wɑkato», lɑ ɑ yeele: «ɑd fo pɑ mi-ɑ mɑ me kɑ mi-ɑ», t'ɑ yeele:  « bɩ f togs mɑɑm ɑ tɑgms-rãmbã». T'ɑ yeele: «yɑɑ yemb-poɑkɑ sẽn nɑ n wɑ rog ɑ zu-soɑbɑ, lɑ fo sẽn nɑ n wɑ yã nɑ-zɑɑlã rãmbɑ sẽn yɑɑ bεεlɑ rãmbɑ sẽn yɑɑ tɑlsã n yɑɑ rũm-gũudbã, tɩ b wogend meebã». Rẽ poorẽ t'ɑ looge tɩ mɑm zĩnd woko, rẽ poorẽ tɩ Nɑbiyɑɑmɑ yeele: « Ʋmɑru! Fo mii sokdɑ bɩɩ?» Tɩ mɑm yeele: «Wẽnd la A Tẽn-tʋʋmɑ n yɩɩd minim». T'ɑ yeele: « ɑd yɑɑ a Gibriilɑ, ɑ wɑɑme n wilgd yãmbɑ y dĩinã».",
    "explanation": "A Ʋmar kõta kibare (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) t'a Gibriila, a puka Sahaabsẽ wã -Wẽnd yard be b yĩnga- t'a yaa sẽn rɩk rao naande, tɩ b ka mi-a ye, la a sɩfã yaa t'a fuugã yaa peell wʋsgo, t'a zoobdã yaa sabell wʋsgo, b ka ne sor tagmas a zug sẽn yaa yaamse, la wubsgu la zoobd zũndgr la futã rẽgd ye, ned baa a yembr ka mi-a zĩidbã sʋk ye, tɩ bãmb zĩ Nabiyaamã nengẽ (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) t'a zĩnd Nabiyaamã taoore, tɩ yaa karen-biig zĩndgu, n sok-a lɩslaangã yelle, tɩ Nabiyaamã leok-a ne zeng-raad-kãensã sẽn kʋmde, reeg-f-zugẽ ne sahd a yiiubã la gũus wakat a nu wã, la kõ Zakã b rãmbã, la Ramadaanã no-loeerã maanego, la hagiimdã farilã maaneg sã n yaa tõoda.\n\nTɩ soakdã yeele: «f togs sɩda». Tɩ sahaabsã maan yel-solemde, a sẽn sokd tɩ yaa a sẽn ka mi sokre, rẽ poorẽ t'a yaool n sɩdgd-a wã.\n\nRẽ poorẽ t'a sok-a sɩd-kũunã yelle, t'a loek-a ne zeng-raad-kãensã a yoobã, sẽn kʋmbde, kõ sɩd ne Wẽnde belmã, A Naam yɩ wagelle, la A sɩf-rãmbã la f leb n welg n kõ-A tʋʋm ning sẽn yaa Yẽ tʋʋma, wala naanegã, la f leb n welg n kõ-A tũudumã, la f kõ sɩda tɩ malεgsã b naan-b lame ne nuura, tɩ b yaa yembs b sẽn waooge, b ka kɩɩsd Wẽnde, A Naam yɩ wagell n zẽke, la yaa Wẽnd sagellã la b tʋmda, la f kõ sɩda ne gaf-rãmb nins sẽn sig tẽn-tʋʋmbã zugã, sẽn yi Wẽnd nengẽ wã, A Naam yɩ wagelle, wala Alkʋrãanã la Tawraatã la Lingiilã la sẽn wõnd rẽ, la kõ sɩd ne tẽn-tʋʋmb nins sẽn taasd dĩinã Wẽnd yĩngã, sẽn be b pʋgẽ yaa a Nuuhu, la a ɭbraahɩɩma, la a Muusa la a ɭɩsa la b baasdgã yaa a Mohammade, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) la zẽng sẽn ka bãmba sẽn yaa nabiyaam-rãmb la tẽn-tʋʋmbã, la kõ sɩd ne yaoolem raarã la yεl nins sẽn be kũumã poorẽ wã, kẽeda yẽnda pʋgẽ, sẽn yaa kabr nango la vɩɩm ning sẽn be yaadẽ wã, la f kõ sɩd tɩ ninsaalã b yikd-a lame kũumã poorẽ, n geel a tʋʋmã, t'a kẽngr zĩigẽ, arzãnã maa Bugmẽ. La kõ sɩd tɩ Wẽnd korda yεlã n zems wala Wẽnd bãngrã sẽn dag n reng taoor tɩ na n yɩɩme wã, la A sẽn gʋls rẽndã la A tʋlsmã, la a sẽn na yɩ wala A sẽn kord-a to-to ningã. Rẽ poorẽ t'a sok-a manegrã yelle, tɩ Nabiyaamã kõ-a kibar tɩ ad manegre, yaa fo tũ Wẽnde, tɩ yaa wala fo ne-A lame, rẽnd f sã n ka paam sor n na n ta dargε-kãngã bɩ f tũ tɩ yaa wala Wẽnd nee foom, rẽnd rẽenem yaa seedg la gesg dargε, ning f yamẽ tɩ yaa wala fo nee Wẽndã, yẽnda la rẽenem dargε, yẽ me n leb n zẽk n yɩɩda, yiib soaba yaa gũus Wẽndã dargε sẽn ta zĩig ningã.\n\nRẽ poorẽ t'a sok-a dũni wã yikr yaa rabʋre? Tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) vẽneg n wilg tɩ ad dũni wã yikri yaa bũmb ning Wẽnd sẽn bas a bãngrã A nangẽ, rẽnd bõn-naandg baa a yembr ka mi-a ye, b sẽn sokd a soabã la soakdã meng me ka mi ye.\n\nRẽ poorẽ t'a sok-a dũni wã yikr tagmas-rãmbã? Tɩ Nɑbiyɑɑmã vẽneg n wilgi (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) tɩ sẽn be ɑ tɑgmes-rãmbã pʋgẽ yɑɑ yem-pogs wʋsgre lɑ b koɑmbã. mɑɑ koɑmbã sẽn nɑmsd b mɑ-rãmbã sẽn nɑ n wʋsge, tɩ b tʋmd ne b mɑ-rãmbã wɑlɑ yem-pogse, tɩ lɑ rũm-kɩɩmbã lɑ tɑlsã b nɑ n wɑ lebgɑ arzεgs rãmbɑ zãmɑɑn yɑoog wɑkɑto, tɩ b pugd tɑɑbɑ ne rot nɑgsgo lɑ b tombo (meebo).\n\nRẽ poorẽ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kõ kibare tɩ ad sokdã yaa a Gibriila, a waame n na n wilg sahaabsã dĩin-kãngã sẽn yaa tẽeg tɩrg dĩinã.",
    "hints": [
          "Hadiisã wilgda Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) zʋg sõngã sẽn ta zĩig ninga, n wilgdẽ t'a zĩi ne Sahaabsã, tɩ b zĩ ne-a.",
          "Wilgda sari wã sẽn kõ sor tɩ b sõmb n maana bʋg-bʋg ne sokda la b pẽneg-a t'a faseme, sẽn na yɩlẽ t'a tõog n leok sokrã tɩ rabeem ka be ye.",
          "Hadiisã wilgda zʋgd maaneg ne karen-saamba, wala a Gibriil -Tɩlgr be a yĩng- sẽn maan Nabiyaamã, bala a zĩnda Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) taoore, zʋgd soab zĩndig buudu, sẽn na yɩl n paam n reeg bãngre a nengẽ.",
          "Yaa tɩ lɩslaangã zeng-raad yaa a nu la sɩd-kũunã yẽga yaa a yoobe.",
          "Sɩd-kũunã la lɩslaangã sã n wa tʋg n lagem taab bũmb a yembr zugu, b welgda lɩslaangã ne tʋʋm nins sẽn be yɩnga, la b rɩk sɩd-kũunã ne tʋʋm nins sẽn be pʋgẽ wã.",
          "Wilgdame tɩ dĩinã a yaa dargε-rãmb sẽn yõs taaba, rẽnd dargε rẽengã yaa lɩslaango, la yiib soaba yaa sɩd-kũuni, tãab soaba yaa manegre, yẽnd n tʋg n zẽk n yɩɩda.",
          "Yaa tɩ yẽgrã soakda yɩta minim kaalgo, la zɩɩlmã me n yɩt sabab tɩ b sokã, rẽ n kɩt tɩ sahaabsã maan yel-solemd ne a sẽn sokd la a sɩdgdẽ wã.",
          "Hadiisã wilgdame tɩ b sõmb n sɩnga ne yell ning sẽn pak n yɩɩda n yaool n ges sẽn pʋgde, bala a sɩnga ne sahd a yiibã lɩslaangã welgsg pʋgẽ, la a sɩng ne Wẽnd yembgã ne sɩd-kũunã welsg zĩigẽ.",
          "Wilgda b sẽn na n sok bãngdã bũmb ning soakda sẽn ka zɩ, tɩ yaa sẽn na n wilg a to sẽn ka mi, t'a bãnge.",
          "Wilgdame tɩ dũni wã yikr yaa minim-rãmb nins A sẽn welg ne A Mengã toor zalle.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A Muslim n togs-a",
  },
  4564: {
