    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAbdʋllaah ɭbn Bašɩɩr nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), tɩ raoa n yeel Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã, ad lɩslaangã sãri-rãmbã lebga wʋsg mam zugu, bɩ f kõ maam kibar bũmb tɩ m gãd-a, t'a yeele: «F zelemdã ra bak n yaa maasr ne Wẽnd yʋʋrã tẽegr ye».",
    "explanation": "Raoa n yeel Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) tɩ ad naafɩl-rãmbã la tũud-rãmbã b lebga wʋsg a zugu, halɩ t'a kong pãnga a valengã yĩngã, rẽ poorẽ t'a kos Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) t'a tees-a tʋʋm yol-yole, sẽn takd yel-sõmd bedre, t'a loe a mengã ne-a la a gãd-a.\n\nTɩ Nabiyaamã togl-a (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) n yeel-a t'a zelemdã ra bak n yaa maasre, n rãmbd wakat fãa ne Wẽnd yʋʋrã tẽegre (A Naam yɩlg n zẽke) wakat la halhaal pʋgẽ fãa; sẽn yaa Sʋbhaanallaah, la Alhamdu lillaah, la astagfirullaah, la doaaga la sẽn wõnd rẽ.",
    "hints": [
          "Wẽnd yʋʋrã tẽegr ne duungu yɩɩdlemã (A Naam zẽk yã).",
          "Sẽn be Wẽnd yɩɩdlem sẽn zɩsã, yaa A sẽn yols keoorã paoong sabab-rãmbã.",
          "Wilgda yembsã sẽn yɩɩgd taaba b keoorã pʋgẽ, manegrã la yel-sõmdã ragnoyã.",
