    "hadeeth": "Yii a Anas nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) tɩ yii Nabiyaamã nengẽ, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) a yeelame: «Yãmb yembr fãa ka kõt sɩda (ne Wẽnde) hal t'a wa tʋg n nong ne a ma-biiga bũmb ning a sẽn nong ne a mengã».",
