          "A An-Nawawiy (Wẽnd na yols-a) a yeelame: Bãngdbã yõsa taaba b sẽn yeel t'a (sẽbda a sʋkã) maanã: b yeelame tɩ yaa nigd pãng tũudmã pʋgẽ n paas a sẽn da minim n maandẽ wã, t'a võorã yaa: kool f nusi tũudmã pʋgẽ, b yetame t'a a sẽba a sʋka ne yel-kãngã, t'a võorã yaa : t'a nidga pãngã n rɩk a wakatã fãa n kɩse, tɩ koεεg a yembr yeele tɩ yaa sẽn gom n yege, n wilgd tɩ b ball n bas pagbã, ne b sẽn maand soagl ne tũudmã.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "B zemsa taab a zugu (A Al-Bʋẖaariy la a Muslim n reeg-a)",
  },
  4947: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "Mam poorẽ rãmbã fãa kẽeda arzãna, sã n pa sẽn tõdga",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Hʋrayrat nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeelame: «Mam poorẽ rãmbã fãa kẽeda arzãna, sã n pa sẽn tõdga», tɩ b yeele: yaa foom Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã! La ãnd n na n tõdge? T'a yeele: «sẽn tũ a maam kẽeda arzãna, la sẽn kɩɩsa maam, a soab tõdgame».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kõta kibare t'a poorẽ rãmbã fãa kẽeda arzãna, sã n ka sẽn gɩdga a menga!\n\nTɩ sahaabsã, -Wẽnd yard be b yĩnga- yeele: la ãnd n na n tõdge, Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã?!\n\nT'a leok-ba, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) tɩ ned ning sẽn sak n pʋge la a tũ Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) sagellã, a kẽeda arzãna, la sã n yaa sẽn kɩɩsa la a zags sari wã tũubu, yẽ soab tõdgame t'a ka na kẽ arzãn ye ne a tʋʋm wẽnsã.",
    "hints": [
          "Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) tũubã, a yaa Wẽnd tũubu, a kɩɩsgã me yaa Wẽnd kɩɩsgo.",
          "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) tũubã kẽesda ned arzãna la a kɩɩsgã kẽesda ned Bugum.",
          "Wãnde yaa sũ-noogr n kõt neb nins sẽn yaa tũudbã zãmã-kãngã pʋgẽ wã la kõt kibar tɩ b fãa gill kẽeda arzãna, sã n ka ned ning sẽn kɩɩsa Wẽnd la A Tẽn-tʋʋmã.",
          "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) nimbãan zoεεga ne a poorẽ rãmbã la a nonglem kεgengã ne b kãndgrã.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A Al-Bʋẖaariy n togs-a",
  },
  4950: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "Yamb nao-kadem a yiibã ka na n zẽke, halɩ tɩ b wa tʋg n sok-a a vɩɩmã a sẽn sεεs-a zĩig ningã, la a bãngrã, a sẽn tʋm bũmb ning ne-a, la a arzεkã, yaa yε la a paam-a la a kẽes-a-la yεεnẽ, la a yĩngã a sẽn kʋɩdg-a zĩig ningã",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Barzat Al-aslamiy nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋm (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) a yeelame-: «Yamb nao-kadem a yiibã ka na n zẽke, halɩ tɩ b wa tʋg n sok-a a vɩɩmã a sẽn sεεs-a zĩig ningã, la a bãngrã, a sẽn tʋm bũmb ning ne-a, la a arzεkã, yaa yε la a paam-a la a kẽes-a-la yεεnẽ, la a yĩngã a sẽn kʋɩdg-a zĩig ningã».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) kõta kibare, tɩ ad ned baa a yembr ka na n zẽk a naoorã n gãndag tʋʋmã geelg zĩigẽ, dũni yikr raare, n tʋg arzãnã maa Bugmẽ, halɩ tɩ b wa tʋg n sok-a yεla:\n\nRẽenemã: yaa a vɩɩmã a sẽn sεεs-a la a sẽn maan-a bũmb ning pʋgẽ.\n\nYiib soabã: yaa a bãngrã, a bao-a-la Wẽnd yĩng bɩɩ? La a tʋma ne bãngrã bɩɩ? La a taasa bãngrã neb nins b sẽn sõmb n taasã bɩɩ?\n\nTãab soabã: yaa a arzεkã, yaa yε la a paam-a, a yaa halaal bɩ yaa haraam? Yaa yε la a kẽes-a? Yaa bũmb ning sẽn yard Wẽnd bɩ yaa sẽn gẽed-A?\n\nNaas soabã: Yaa a yĩngã la a pãngã la a laafɩ wã la a rasãndlemã, a zar-b lame la a rɩk-b n tʋm bõe pʋga?",
    "hints": [
          "Yaa b kẽes vɩɩmã bũmb ning sẽn yard Wẽnde, (A Naam zẽkame).",
          "Wẽnd neemã wã yembsã zug yaa wʋsgo, la A na n sok-b lame neemã ning pʋgẽ bãmb sẽn da beẽ wã, rẽnd yaa tɩlae ne-b tɩ b rɩk Wẽnd neemã wã n ning zĩig ning Wẽnd sẽn yarde.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A At-tirmiiziy n togs-a",
  },
  4958: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "Mam na n kõo tap-kao-kãngã raoa, sẽn nong Wẽend la A Tẽn-tʋʋmã, Wẽnd na n paka sẽn tũ ne a nugu",
    "hadeeth": "Yi a Abɩɩ Hʋrayrat nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeela Haybar raarã: «Mam na n kõo tap-kao-kãngã raoa, sẽn nong Wẽend la A Tẽn-tʋʋmã, Wẽnd na n paka sẽn tũ ne a nugu». A ʿƲmar ɭbn Al-ẖaṭṭaab yeelame: mam ka yɩ n nong naam sã n ka ra-kãngã, a yeelame: tɩ mam yals m na-biisã zutu, n tẽed tɩ b na bool maam n kõ-a. Tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) bool a ʿAli ɭbn Abɩɩ Taalib, n kõ-a la a yeele: «Kẽng la f ra wẽnems ye, halɩ tɩ Wẽnd wa pak n kõ-fo». A yeelame: t'a ʿAli kẽng bilfu, rẽ poorẽ t'a yals la a ka wẽnem ye, n yeele: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã, m zab ne nebã bõe poorẽ? T'a yeele: «Zab ne-ba halɩ tɩ b maan kaset tɩ soab sẽn na n tũ n tɩlg ka be rẽnda Wẽnde, la a Mʋhammad yaa Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, la b sã n maan woto, sɩd la hakɩɩka b gɩdga foom b zɩɩmã la b arzεgsã, rẽnda hakε-rãmb sẽn nɑ n zomb-ba, la b geelgã bee ne Wẽnde».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) kõo Ṣahaabsã kibar tɩ lɩslaambã na n tõoga Yahuud-rãmbã beoogo, Haybare, yaa tẽng sẽn pẽ Madiina, la woto yaa sẽn na n tũ ne raoa yẽ sẽn na n kõ-a tãp-kaoorã, la rao-kãngã a sɩf-rãmbẽ wã yaa t'a nonga Wẽnd la A Tẽn-tʋʋmã, tɩ Wẽnd ne A tẽn-tʋʋmã nong-a.\n\nLa sɩd la hakɩɩka a ʿƲmar ɭbn Al-hattaab (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) tẽegame tɩ ad yẽ ka yɩ n nong naam sã n ka ra-kãng raarã, n leb n rat tɩ yɩ yẽnda la b sẽn tʋllã rẽnda ra-kãnga, la yaa tẽeb tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) sẽn yeelã na paam-a, sẽn yaa Wẽnd la A Tẽn-tʋʋmã nonglemã, la a ʿƲmar (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) sɩndgɑ a mengã, tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) na yã-a, tɩ yaa tẽeb tɩ b bool-a n kõ-a, la yã-beed maanego ne tãp-kao-kãng reegre.\n\nTɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) bool a ʿAli ɭbn Abɩɩ Taalib (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) n kõ-a. La Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) sagl-a lame t'a rãmb ne tãpã (sodaasã), la a ra loog n bas zabrã a sẽn yek bε wã poorẽ ye, n na n vʋʋse maa yalsgo, maa zems-taaba halɩ tɩ Wẽnd wa pak kadeng-kãensã n kõ-a, ne sõngr la wilbu.\n\nT'a ʿAli (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) kẽnge rẽ poorẽ n yals la a ka wẽneg ye, sẽn na yɩl n ra yõsg Nabiyaamã saglgã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩgr be a yĩnga), la a (ʿAli, Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) zẽk a koεεga n yeele: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã, m zab nebã bõe poorẽ?\n\nT'a yeele (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga): Zab ne-ba halɩ tɩ b maan kaset tɩ soab sẽn na n tũ n tɩlg ka be rẽnda Wẽnde, la a Mʋhammad yaa Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã, la b sã n sake, n kẽ lɩslaangã, sɩd la hakɩɩka b gɩdga foom b zɩɩmã la b arzεgsã, rẽnda a hakε wã, rat n yeel tɩ rẽndame tɩ b maana yel-beedo, maa b kʋʋ neda, tɩ yaa tɩlae tɩ b maan-b woto, n zems ne lɩslaangã bʋʋdã. La b geelg bee ne Wẽnde.",
    "hints": [
          "Ṣahaabsã rag n yɩɩme n kis naamã, bala be a pʋgẽ tʋʋmd sẽn zɩse.",
          "Wilgdame tɩ sakdame tɩ f zẽk f zugu la f bao taaore ne yelle, t'a sõmã wã sã n yaa vẽenega.",
          "Limaamã sẽn kõt teesg sor ning sodaasã taoor soabã sẽn sõmb n maan zabrã laagẽ.",
          "Wilgda Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋm Ṣahaabsã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) sẽn tũud a saglsã la b yãgd n na n yik ne-ba.",
          "Ned ning b sẽn sok a yelle tɩ gĩd-a bɩ a sok-a.",
          "Sẽn be a nabiyaamdemã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) daliil-rãmbẽ, yaa a sẽn kõ kibar tɩ b na n tõoga Yahuud-rãmba, la a sẽn kõ kibar tɩ Haybar na n pakame wã, t'a yɩ wala a sẽn togsã.",
          "Yaa pirsg ne taoor kẽngr la yãg n tʋg Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã  sẽn sagl bũmb ningã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ).",
          "Ka sakd tɩ b kʋ ned ning sẽn yeela kaset-rãmb a yiibã, rẽndame tɩ vẽnega a nengẽ bũmb ning sẽn yaa tɩlae tɩ b kʋ-a.",
          "Lɩslaamdã bʋʋdã kẽnesda bũmb ning sẽn yaa vẽeneg zugu nebã nengẽ, la b yel-soondɩ wã zaoo Wẽnde.",
          "Gɩhaadɩ wã raab zɩsgã yaa nebã na kẽ lɩslaangã.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A Muslim n togs-a",
  },
  4964: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "Lɩslaam fu-sẽk (kurgu=fuugu) yaa a kar-koeemsã pʋsʋka, la taal ka be ne bũmb ning sẽn be kar-koεεngã la na-kugã sʋk ye, la bũmb ning sẽn sig na-kugã tẽngrã yẽ yaa Bugmẽ, la ned ning sẽn vuuga a fu-sẽka waoog-m-menga, Wẽnd ka gεt-a ye",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Saʿʿɩɩd Al-ẖʋdriy nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame, Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), yeelame: «Lɩslaam fu-sẽk (kurgu=fuugu) yaa a kar-koeemsã pʋsʋka, la taal ka be ne bũmb ning sẽn be kar-koεεngã la na-kugã sʋk ye, la bũmb ning sẽn sig na-kugã tẽngrã yẽ yaa Bugmẽ, la ned ning sẽn vuuga a fu-sẽka waoog-m-menga, Wẽnd ka gεt-a ye».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) vẽnegdame n wilgdẽ, tɩ lɩslaam raoog fu-sẽka, la yẽ me yaa bũmb ning fãa sẽn lut rapã tẽngrã, a tara halhaal a tãabo: Rẽenemã: yaa b sẽn bʋ nonglem, yẽnda yaa a zems kar-koεεngã pʋsʋka. Yiib soaba: yaa sẽn sakde, tɩ kisgr ka be ye, yẽ me la sẽn be kar-koeemsã tẽngre halɩ n tʋg n tãag na-kugã, na-kugã me la kõb a yiib nins sẽn nok na-tagdɩ wã la kargã sũgsã zĩigẽ. Tãab soaba: Yaa haraam, yẽ la sẽn be na-kugã tẽngrã, b yεεsda yãwã soab zug tɩ Bugum ra wa paam-a ye, la sã n mikame t'a sẽn maana yaa waoog-m-menga, la pugbu, la kedgre, Wẽnd kõ n ges-a ye.",
    "hints": [
          "Sɩf-kãngã la pʋleng wẽng-kãngã welga ne rapã, la pagbã b tũus-b lame n welg n yiis yel-kãngã pʋgẽ; bala b sagla bãmb tɩ b lud b yĩnsã gilli.",
          "Bũmb fãa sẽn lut rao karsã, b boondame tɩ fu-sẽka, wala pãntalõ-rãmbã, la futã la sẽn wõnd rẽ, la b kẽeda sãri wã bʋʋd-rãmb b sẽn togsã, hadiis-kãngã pɩugẽ wã.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A Abʋʋ Daawʋʋd la a ɭbn Maaǧa la a Ahmad n togs-a",
  },
  4965: {
    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "Fighu wã ne Yẽgã",
    "title": "A Gibriil ka bak n sagend maam ne yaka, halɩ tɩ mam da tẽed t'a na n lagem-a-la fa-rɩtbẽ wã",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ɭbn Ʋmar nengẽ, -Wẽnd yard be n yiibã yĩnga-, a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeelame: \"A Gibriil ka bak n sagend maam ne yaka, halɩ tɩ mam da tẽed t'a na n lagem-a-la fa-rɩtbẽ wã\".",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kõta kibare, t'a Gibriila ka bake, n yɩlemd yẽndã zugu, la a sagend-a t'a nidg pãng ne a yaka, yak ning  zak sẽn pẽ wã, zem tɩ yaa lɩslaama maa yaa kɩfre, zem t'a yaa rog pẽta maa a ka rog pẽta, a sagendame tɩ b gũus a hakε wã la b ra nams-a ye, la b maneg-a la b maan sugr ne a namsgo, halɩ tɩ    Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) wa tẽeda yakã hakε zɩslem sẽn  ta to-to ningã la a Gibriil sẽn yɩlemdã wã, tɩ wahɩ n na n sigi, n kõ-a pʋɩɩre a yakã sẽn basd arzεk ningã a kaalem poorẽ.",
    "hints": [
          "Yakã hakε zɩslem la sẽn yaa tɩlae tɩ b gũ rẽndã wã.",
          "Yakã hakε sẽn kenge ne a Gibriil sagellã, wilgdame tɩ sõmbame tɩ b waoog-a la b bao nonglem ne-a la b maan-a neere, la b tus sẽn namsd fãa n yi-a la b kaag-a bãag wakato la b pʋʋs-a ne zu-noogo, noog sasa la b pʋʋs-a ne toogo, yell sasa.",
          "La yakã ragnoor sẽn pẽneg n yɩɩd fãa la a hakε wã sẽn kengd n paasdẽ.",
          "Wilgda sari sẽn pidi a sẽn wa ne yell ninsã, tɩ be beenẽ sẽn manegd nimbuiidã, sẽn yaa manegr n tʋg yagse, la tus namsg n yi-ba.",
        ],
