    "title": "Sagl-y y koambã tɩ b pʋʋse, tɩ b sã n wa tar yʋʋm a yopoe, la y pãb-ba Pʋʋsgã yĩnga tɩ b sã n wa yaa yʋʋm piig koamba, la y welg-b ne taab sʋka, gãasẽ wã",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAmr ɭbn Šʋʿayb nengẽ, tɩ yii a baabã nengẽ, tɩ yii a yaab nengẽ: a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-ntʋʋmã, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeelame: «Sagl-y y koambã tɩ b pʋʋse, tɩ b sã n wa tar yʋʋm a yopoe, la y pãb-ba Pʋʋsgã yĩnga tɩ b sã n wa yaa yʋʋm piig koamba, la y welg-b ne taab sʋka, gãasẽ wã».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) vẽnegdame n wilgdẽ, tɩ zaoo ne baaba t'a sagl a koambã -roaop la pagba- tɩ b pʋʋse, b yʋʋmã sẽn wat n ta yopoe, la a wilg-ba bũmb ning sẽn tar tʋlsem ne-a sẽn na n yals ne Pʋʋsgã. La b sẽn wat n ta yʋʋm piiga, yellã paasdame, rẽnd b pãbd-b lame b sã n maan n kʋʋg a pʋgẽ, la b welg-b taaba pĩ-gãagẽ wã.",
    "hints": [
