    "title": "Ned ning sẽn so arzũm raar gεnaab koom, rẽ poorẽ n kẽng pĩndɑ, yaa wala a maana doaag ne yʋgemde",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Hʋrayrat nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeelame: «Ned ning sẽn so arzũm raar gεnaab koom, rẽ poorẽ n kẽng pĩndɑ, yaa wala a maana doaag ne yʋgemde, la ned ning sẽn kẽnga wakɑt a yiibã, yaa wala a maana doaag ne naafo, la ned ning sẽn kẽnga wakat a tãabã, yaa wala a maana doaag ne pesg sẽn tar yɩɩla, la ned ning sẽn kẽnga wakat a naasã, yaa wala a maana doaag ne noaaga, la ned ning sẽn kẽnga wakat a nu wã, yaa wala a maana doaag ne gelle, la limaamã sã n yi malεgsã watame n kelgd Tẽegrã».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã kõta kibare (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kẽng pĩnd n tʋg arzũmã Pʋʋsgẽ wã yel-sõmde, la a sɩngda ne wĩndgã pukr n tʋg n tãag limaamã waoongo, a yaa wakat a nu, tɩ b pʋɩt-a-la boag a nu n zems ne wĩndgã pukri n tʋg tãag limaamã kõom la a mimbarã rʋʋbo:\n\nRẽenemã: Ned ning sẽn so koom n pids wala gεnaam koom, rẽ poorẽ n kẽng arzũm miisrẽ wã, rẽenem wakatã, yaa wala a maana doaag ne yʋgemde.\n\nYiib soaba: ned ning sẽn kẽnga wakɑt a yiibã, yaa wala a maana doaag ne naafo.\n\nTãab soaba: ned ning sẽn kẽnga wakat a tãabã, yaa wala a maana doaag ne pe-raoog sẽn tar yɩɩla.\n\nNaas soaba: ned ning sẽn kẽnga wakat a naasã, yaa wala a maana doaag ne noaaga.\n\nNu soaba: ned ning sẽn kẽnga wakat a nu wã, yaa wala a maana doaag ne gelle.\n\nLa limaamã sã n yi n na n maan hʋtbã wã, malεgsã sẽn zĩ ragnoyẽ wã n gʋlsd miisrã rẽenem kẽedbã la sẽn pʋgdbã, b yalsda gʋlsgã, la b wa n kelgd Tẽegrã la Hʋtbã.",
    "hints": [
