          "A ɭbn Ragεb yeelame: a koεεgã sẽn yeel tɩ \"ned ning sẽn so arzũm raar gεnaab koom, rẽ poorẽ n kẽngã\" wilgdame tɩ bʋʋ nonglem ne arzũm koom soobo, sẽn sɩng fɑgirã pukri, la a yaoolmã yaa yi wĩndgã pukr poorẽ n kẽng ɑrzũmã.",
