    "hadeeth": "Yii a Sahl ɭbn Mʋ'ʿaaz ɭbn Anas nengẽ, tɩ yii a saamba nengẽ, a yeelame: tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeelame: «Ned ning sẽn rɩ rɩɩbo, n yeele: Alhamdu lillaahi Allaḏii aṭ-ʿamanii haaḏaa, wa razaƙaniihi min ġayri hawlin minnii walaa ƙuwwatin= (Pẽgr be ne Naab ning sẽn rɩlga maam wãndã, la A lok-a maam, tɩ ka tũ ne sɩlem, la pãnga sẽn yi mam nengẽ), b yaafda a zũnuub sẽn reng taoore».",
