    "title": "Yãn-zoεεg bee liimaoong pʋgẽ",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abdʋllaah ɭbn Amr nengẽ - Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga- t'a yeelame: Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) wʋma raoa sẽn sagend a ma-biig yãn-zoεεg wεεngẽ, t'a yeele: \"Yãn-zoεεg bee liimaoong pʋgẽ\".",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) wʋma raoa t'a sagend a ma-biiga t'a bas yãn-zoεεgã wʋsgã, tɩ Nabiyaamã na n vẽneg n wilg-a tɩ yãn-zoεεgã a bee liimaoong pʋgẽ, a ka wat ne rẽnda sẽn yaa sõma.\n\nLa yãn-zoεεgã a yaa zʋgdo sẽn yɩt sabab tɩ ninsaal maan tʋʋm sõnga la a bas wẽnga.",
    "hints": [
