  5482: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "M Soab a Wẽnde maneg m dĩinã n kõ-ma, sẽn yaa mam yellã gũudmã",
    "hadeeth": "Yii Abɩɩ Hʋrɑyrɑt nengẽ (Wẽnd yɑrd be ɑ yĩngɑ) a yeelɑme: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmɑ (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) rag n yɩɩme n yetẽ: «M Soab a Wẽnde maneg m dĩinã n kõ-ma, sẽn yaa mam yellã gũudmã, la F maneg m dũni wã n kõ-ma sẽn yaa mam vɩɩmã sẽn be a pʋgẽ wã, la F maneg m laahrã n kõ-ma, sẽn yaa mam lebεngã sẽn togdẽ wã, la F maan vɩɩmã tɩ yaa paasg ne-ma sõma fãa pʋgẽ, la F maan kũumã tɩ yaa vʋʋsg ne maam n yi wẽng buudã fãa».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) a kosa kosgo, n tigim a pʋgẽ, zʋg sõmsã yẽgã b sẽn tʋms-a t'a wa pidsã, bãmb me la dĩinã la dũni wã la laahrã manegre, rẽnd a tũusa gom-bi-kãensã sẽn yaa koεεgã, yel-kãensã b tãabã manegre, la a sɩnga ne dĩinã manegre, yẽ sã n manege, zags a yiibã manegr bee ne rẽnda, dũni la laahrã, rẽnd a yeelame:\n\n(M Soab a Wẽnde maneg m dĩinã n kõ-ma) Rat n yeele: maan-m sabab sõngo tɩ m yals ne zʋg sõngã ne neng sẽn maneg n yɩɩda.\n\n(Sẽn yaa mam yellã gũudmã) La yẽ n gũusd mam yεlã fãa gilli, rẽnd mam dĩinã sã n sãame, m bõn yã, rat n wilgame tɩ dĩinã yell ka maneg wala b sẽn ratã, rẽndame tɩ dũni wã yell n manege, t'a yeele:\n\n(La F maneg m dũni wã n kõ-ma) ne Fo sẽn na n kõ maam laafɩ m yĩngẽ wã la bas-m-yam, la rɩtla, la pʋg-sõngo, la koamb sẽn yaa sõma, la mam sẽn tar tʋlsem fãa, tɩ yɩ halaale, n sõngd maam tɩ m tũ Fo, rẽ poorẽ t'a togs padanga a sẽn kot dũnu wã manegrã sababã, n yeele:\n\n(Sẽn yaa mam vɩɩmã sẽn be a pʋgẽ wã) Mam vɩɩmã zĩig la a wakatã.\n\n(La F maneg m laahrã n kõ-ma, sẽn yaa mam lebεngã sẽn togdẽ wã) La mam lebgrã n tʋg Fo yekrã la rẽnda yaa sẽn tũ ne tʋʋmã manegre, la Wẽnd segl sõngã ne A yembsã zugu la pʋ-peelem maanego, la baas neere.\n\nLa Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) tũnuga taaba n yeel laahrã, dũni wã poorẽ; bala rẽenem soabã, yẽ yaa radg sẽn na n tũ n maneg yiib soabã, rẽnd ned ning sẽn tẽega tɩrga a dũni wã yellẽ, wala Wẽnd sẽn ratã, a laahrã na n tẽega tɩrga, t'a paam zu-noog a pʋgẽ.\n\n(La F maan vɩɩmã) la yõorã woglem (tɩ yaa paasg ne-ma sõma fãa pʋgẽ,) tɩ mam wʋsg a pʋgẽ tʋʋm sõmse, (la F maan kũumã) la a yãgbã (tɩ yaa vʋʋsg ne maam n yi wẽng buudã fãa) la fitna (zarb-n-gesga) la masɩɩba, la zarbgo, la Wẽnd kɩɩsgo la yam yaal-yaale, la fãagre n yi dũni wã yεlã, la laafɩ la vʋʋsg paoongo.",
    "hints": [
          "Dĩinã yẽnda la bũmb sẽn tʋg n pak n yɩɩda; rẽ n kɩt tɩ Nabiyaamã sɩng ne a kosgã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ).",
          "Dĩinã yaa gũudum ne ninsaala n gɩdgd-a n yi wẽng buud fãa.",
          "Tõeeme n kos dũni yεla tɩ yaa sẽn na maneg dĩinã la laahrã yĩnga.",
          "B ka kisgd kũum tẽebo, tɩ sã n mikame tɩ yaa yεεs tɩ f na n lʋɩ fɩtnã pʋgẽ dĩinẽ wã, maa kos Wẽnd n ki Šahaada zugu, yẽnda kisgr ka be ye.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A Muslim n togs-a",
  },
  5483: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "M Soab A Wẽnde, yaaf-ma m sẽn tudgi la m sẽn zɩ la m maan-n-zʋʋkã m yellã fãa pʋgẽ, la Fo sẽn mi bũmb ninga n yɩɩd maam. M Soab A Wẽnde, yaaf-ma m sẽn tudgi la m pʋ-toogo, la m zɩɩlem la m reem, la woto fãa gill yii mam nengẽ. M Soab A Wẽnde, yaaf-ma m sẽn tʋm tɩ reng taoore, lɑ m sẽn yɑoolge, lɑ m sẽn solge la m sẽn vẽnege, Foom A Wẽnd la Lʋɩɩs taoor Naaba, la Foom la Yaoolgda, la Foom la bũmbã fãa gill Tõogda",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Muusa nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), tɩ yii Nabiyaamã nengẽ (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) t'a rag n yɩɩme n kot do-kãngã: «M Soab A Wẽnde, yaaf-ma m sẽn tudgi la m sẽn zɩ la m maan-n-zʋʋkã m yellã fãa pʋgẽ, la Fo sẽn mi bũmb ninga n yɩɩd maam. M Soab A Wẽnde, yaaf-ma m sẽn tudgi la m pʋ-toogo, la m zɩɩlem la m reem, la woto fãa gill yii mam nengẽ. M Soab A Wẽnde, yaaf-ma m sẽn tʋm tɩ reng taoore, lɑ m sẽn yɑoolge, lɑ m sẽn solge la m sẽn vẽnege, Foom A Wẽnd la Lʋɩɩs taoor Naaba, la Foom la Yaoolgda, la Foom la bũmbã fãa gill Tõogda».",
    "explanation": "Bee Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) doosã sẽn tigim bũmbã fãa wã, a sẽn ra yete:\n\n\"M Soab A Wẽnde, yaaf-ma m sẽn tudgi\" la m zũnuubã, \"la m sẽn zɩ\" la bũmb ning sẽn yi mam nengẽ tɩ ka yɩ ne bãngre.\n\n\"La m maan-n-zʋʋkã m yellã fãa gilli\" la m kʋʋg koεεga la m maan tɩ loog toadgã.\n\n\"La Fo sẽn mi bũmb ninga n yɩɩd maam\" Fo mi-a lame, m Soab A Wẽnde, tɩ mam yĩm-a.\n\n\"M Soab A Wẽnde, yaaf-ma m sẽn tudgi la m pʋ-toogo\" La bũmb ning sẽn yi mam nengẽ ne pʋ-toogo la zũnuub ning mam sẽn mi.\n\n\"La m sẽn maan sɩd-sɩdã la m reemã\" la bũmb ning sẽn yi mam nengẽ tɩ yaa reem, la bũmb ning sẽn yi mam nengẽ halhaal a yiibã fãa gilli.\n\n\"La woto fãa gill yii mam nengẽ\" zĩ-kãngã b sẽn togsã tigma zũnuub-rãmbã la zamse.\n\n\"M Soab A Wẽnde, yaaf-ma m sẽn tʋm tɩ reng taoore\" tɩ loogã, \"la m sẽn yaoolge\" sẽn na n watã.\n\n\"La m sẽn solge\" la mam sẽn lilli, \"la m sẽn vẽnege\" la m yiis yɩnga.\n\n\"Foom A Wẽnd la Lʋɩɩs taoor Naaba\" la Foom la Yaoolgda\" F lʋɩɩsda taoor Fo sẽn tʋll-a, Fo yembsã pʋgẽ, n tʋg Fo yolsgẽ wã, ne Fo segl sõngã f sẽn yard bũmb ningã, Foom n leb n yaoolgd F sẽn tʋll a soaba, n yaand-a ne Fo sẽn bas-a wã, la ned ka be n tõe n leb lʋɩɩs tɑoore bũmb ning Fo sẽn yaoolg ye, la ned me ka be n tõe n yaoolg bũmb ning Fo sẽn lʋɩɩs taoore yεlã pʋgẽ ye.\n\n\"La Foom la bũmbã fãa gill Tõogda\" tɩ F tõog yaa sẽn pidi, F raab yaa sẽn pidi, n maand F sẽn rat fãa.",
    "hints": [
          "Yaa doaag-kãngã yɩɩdlemã la yã-beed maaneg ne Nabiyaamã tikri (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ).",
          "B gɩdgame tɩ b ra maan n zʋʋg ye, la b bãng tɩ maan-n-zʋʋgã a yaa bũmb sẽn kẽesd ned namsg pʋgẽ.",
          "Wẽnde (A Naam zẽk yã) n tar minim ne ninsaala n yɩɩd a mengã, rẽnd a sõmbame n rogl a yellã ne Wẽnde, bala a tõeeme n tudgi tɩ yẽnda ka mi ye.",
          "Ninsaala b tõe n yõk-a lame a reem pʋgẽ, wala b sẽn tõe n yõk-a a sɩd-sɩd pʋgẽ, rẽnd sõmba ne ninsaala t'a gũus a reemẽ wã.",
          "A ɭbn Hagar Al-Asƙalaaniy yeelame: mam ka yã hadiisã soyã fãa sẽn wilgd zĩig ninga a sẽn kot doaag-kãngã ye, la hadiis-rãmbã wʋsg fãa b baasgẽ wã a yeelame, tɩ Nabiyaamã rag n yeta yãwã yʋng Pʋʋsg pʋgẽ, leb n waame n wilgdẽ t'a rag n yet-a lame Pʋʋsgã baasgẽ, la togsg-rãmbã yõsa taaba: rẽ yĩngã, a rag n yet-a lame taoor t'a na n ka ning saleem bɩ yaa sallemã ningr poorẽ? B yiibã fãa waame.",
          "Rẽ yĩnga (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) tudgdame n baood n na n kos yaafa bɩɩ? B yeelame tɩ Nabiyaamã rag n yeta woto tɩ yaa gãneg-m-menga, leb n yaa a mengã wõrbo. Sã n ka rẽ, a sõda bas bũmb ning sẽn pid n yɩɩdã tɩ põsg foomã, maa fo bas bũmb ning sẽn rag n sõmb n yɩɩd tɩ b mɑɑn-ɑ wã tɩ yaa zũnuuba, maa a rata bũmb ning sẽn yɩ tɩ yaa yĩmbu, maa bũmb ning sẽn rag n yɩ taoor tɩ nabiyaademã na n ka wa wã, tɩ sãnda yeele: tɩ yaafgã kosg meng yaa tũudum, tɩ yaa tɩlae tɩ b wa ne-a, ka zũnuub kosg yĩng ye, la yaa tũudum yĩnga, b yeelame yεsa: tɩ Nabiyaamã sẽn maan woto wã yaa nekre, sẽn na yɩl n karem a poorẽ rãmbã tɩ b ra maan bas-m-yam yaafã kosg ye.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "B zemsa taab a zugu (A Al-Bʋẖaariy la a Muslim n reeg-a)",
  },
  5485: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "Allɑhummɑ ɩnnii ɑs'ɑlukɑ Al-ɑɑfɩyɑtɑ fɩd-Dunyɑɑ wɑl-Aɑẖɩrɑtɩ",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ɭbn ʿƲmar nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga) a yeelame: Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) rag n ka yɩ n basd kos-kãensã, a sẽn wat n ta zaabre, la a sẽn wat n yik yibeoogo:«Allɑhummɑ ɩnnii ɑs'ɑlukɑ Al-ɑɑfɩyɑtɑ fɩd-Dunyɑɑ wɑl-Aɑẖɩrɑtɩ, Allɑhummɑ ɩnnii ɑs'ɑlukɑ Al'ɑfwɑ wɑl- Aɑfɩyɑtɑ fɩɩ diinii wɑ Dunyɑɑyɑ wɑ Ahlɩɩ wɑ Mɑɑlɩɩ, Allɑhummɑ ʋstʋr Awrɑtɩɩ wɑ ɑɑmin Rɑw'ɑɑtɩɩ, Allɑhummɑ ɩhfɑẓnii min bɑyni yɑdɑyyɑ wɑ min ẖɑlfɩɩ wɑ an yɑmiinii wɑ an šɩmɑɑlɩɩ wɑ min fɑwkɩɩ, wɑ ɑʿʋʋḏʋ bɩ Aẓmɑtɩkɑ an ʋgtɑɑlɑ min tɑhtɩɩ. (M Soɑb ɑ Wẽnde mɑm kot-F-lɑ Lɑɑfɩ Dũni lɑ Lɑɑhre, M Soɑb ɑ Wẽnde m kot-F-lɑ Yɑɑfɑ lɑ Lɑɑfɩ m Dĩinɑ pʋgẽ lɑ m Dũni wã lɑ m zɑkã rãmbɑ lɑ m ɑrzεkɑ, m Soɑb ɑ Wẽnde lill m yãnã lɑ F gãneg m pεlgã, m Soɑb ɑ Wẽnde gũ-mɑ m neng tɑoore lɑ m poor wεεngẽ lɑ m rɩtg wεεngẽ lɑ m goɑbg wεεngẽ lɑ m yĩngr wεεngẽ, lɑ m kotɑ gũudum ne Fo Zɩslemã tɩ b rɑ wɑ zãmb n kʋ-mɑ m tẽngrã wεεngẽ ye».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) rag n ka yɩ n basd kos-kãngã a sẽn wat n ta zaabr la a sẽn wat n vẽeg beoogo:\n\n(M Soɑb ɑ Wẽnde mɑm kot-F-lɑ Lɑɑfɩ) la m kot-F-la tɩlgre n yi bãase la balag-rãmba la dũni yel-kεgemse, la yõyã yamleoodo la dĩin zarbgo (dũni kaanẽ la laahr) sẽn yaa tao-tao mas-masã la sẽn yaoondã.\n\n(M Soɑb ɑ Wẽnde m kot-F-lɑ Yɑɑfɑ ) la zũnuub yẽesgo la gãndg n bas-ba (la laafɩ) la tɩlgre n yi zamse (m dĩinã pʋgẽ) tɩ  m yi lagem-n-taare la Bid'ah-rãmb la Wẽnd kɩɩsgo (la m dũni wã) n yi masɩɩb-rãmba la nango la wẽnga (la m zaka rãmba) m pagbã la m koambã la m rog-pẽtse ( la m ligdã) m arzεkã la m tʋʋma.\n\n(m Soɑb ɑ Wẽnde lill m yãnã) la bũmb ning sẽn be mam pʋgẽ sẽn yaa zamse la yεl sẽn keoose, la maan koεεgã la F yẽes m zũnuubã (la F gãneg m pεlεngã) la m yεεsgã.\n\n(m Soɑb ɑ Wẽnde gũ-ma) n tus baolleg-rãmbã n yi-ma, sẽn namsd ninsaala (min bɑyni yɑdɑyyɑ wɑ min ẖɑlfɩɩ wɑ an yɑmiinii wɑ an šɩmɑɑlɩɩ wɑ min fɑwkɩɩ) zĩ-kãngã a kosame tɩ Wẽnd gũ-a n yi ween-n-vɩɩsã gilli, bala baolleg-rãmbã la zamsã b paamda ninsaalã sẽn tũud ne ween-vɩ-kãensã a yembr wεεngẽ.\n\n(la m kot gũudum ne Fo zɩslemã tɩ b rɑ wa zãmb n kʋ-m ye) la b ra zεεg-ma tɩ m wa halk ne lingr ye, (m tẽngrã wεεngẽ), tɩ m wa halk ne Tẽng bõrb ye.",
    "hints": [
          "D sõmb n gũusa gom-kãensã n yet-ba, tɩ yaa Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã tikri (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ).",
          "Ninsaala b sẽn saglg-a t'a kos tɩlgr dĩinã pʋgẽ wã, yaa woto bala b sagend-a lame t'a kos tɩlgre dũni wã yεlẽ.",
          "At-Tɩɩbɩɩ yeelame: t'a gũbga ween-n-vɩɩs a yoobã fãa, bala zamsã yita beenẽ, la a kenga tẽngrã wεεngẽ, bala bãag ning sẽn yita be wã a yaa yook wʋsgo.",
          "Sẽn yaa sõma n yɩɩd doosã karengẽ yaa yibeoogo: fagirã sẽn na n puk n tãag wĩndgã pukri, raarã sɩngrẽ, la sẽn na n leb n sɩng Laansar poorẽ, n tʋg n tãag Magrib noorẽ, la a sã n yeel-a yibeoog wĩndgã sẽn wat n zẽk sasa, sek-a lame, la a sã n yeel-a Zafarã poorẽ sek-a lame, la a sã n yeel-a Magrib poorẽ sek-a lame, bala yẽ fãa ket n yaa Wẽnd yʋʋr tẽegr wakato.",
          "Daliil ka wilgi tɩ Wẽnd yʋʋrã tẽegr tara wakat sẽn welg n yãk yʋngo, wala Al-baƙara (Nɑɑfã sʋʋrɑ) Aayae baasds a yiibã karengã ye, bala yẽnda karengã yɩta yʋngo, wĩndgã lʋɩɩs poorẽ.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A Abʋʋ Daawʋʋd la a An-nasaa'ɩy la a ɭbn Maaǧa la a Ahmad n togs-a",
  },
  5487: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "M Soab A Wẽnde, m kot-F-la sõmã wã gilli, dũni kaanẽ la laahre, m sẽn bãng la m sẽn ka bãnge, la m kot-F-la gũudum n yi wẽngã gilli, a dũni la laahre, mam sẽn bãng la m sẽn ka bãnge",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAaɩša sẽn yaa muumim-rãmbã ma wã nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) a wilg-a-la do-kãngã: «M Soab A Wẽnde, m kot-F-la sõmã wã gilli, dũni kaanẽ la laahre, m sẽn bãng la m sẽn ka bãnge, la m kot-F-la gũudum n yi wẽngã gilli, a dũni la laahre, mam sẽn bãng la m sẽn ka bãnge, m Soab A Wẽnde, m kot-F-la sõma Fo Yambã la F Nabiyaamã sẽn kose, la m kot-F gũudum Fo Yambã la F Nabiyaamã sẽn kos gũudum n yi-a, m Soab A Wẽnde, m kot-F-la arzãnã la bũmb ning sẽn na n pẽneg arzãnã sẽn yaa gomde, maa tʋʋmde, la m kot-F gũudum n yi Bugmã la bũmb ning sẽn pẽnegd maam ne Bugmã, sẽn yaa gomde, maa tʋʋmde, la m kot-F tɩ bʋʋd fãa F sẽn bʋ mam zug bɩ yɩ sõma ne-ma».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) karema a ʿAaɩša (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) doos sẽn tigme, la yaa doos-rãmb a naase:\n\nRẽenemã, yaa doaag sẽn gũbg sõma fãa gilli (M Soab A Wẽnde, m kot-F-la sõmã wã gilli) la b fãa gillã (dũni kaanẽ) sẽn pẽ (la laahre) la sẽn zãre, (m sẽn bãnge) sẽn yi Fo sẽn wilg maamã (la m sẽn ka bãnge), sẽn welg Fo bãngrã pʋgẽ, (F Naam yɩlgame). La bee doaagã pʋgẽ sẽn yaa yell boblg ne Wẽnde, sẽn yaa Mit-kãagã, rẽnd Wẽnd tũusdame n kõ lɩslaamã (A Naam yɩlgame) bũmb ning sẽn tʋg n yaa neer n yɩɩde (la m kot-F-la gũudum) m yõkd F sεεga la m baood gũub ne Foom (n yi wẽngã gilli, a dũni la a laahre, mam sẽn bãng la m sẽn ka bãnge).\n\nDoaag a yiib soabã: yẽ yaa gũusg ne lɩslaam t'a ra maan n zʋʋg kosgã pʋgẽ ye (m Soab A Wẽnde) la m kot Fo nengẽ (m kot-F-la sõma Fo Yambã la F Nabiyaamã sẽn kose (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ), (la m kot-F gũudum Fo Yambã la F Nabiyaamã sẽn kos gũudum n yi-a) (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ), la yãwã la doaag la kosg ne Wẽnde t'A kõ koatã Nabiyaamã a Mʋhammad (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) sẽn kos n kõ a mengã, la ka welg n sõd Nabiyaamã sẽn rag n kos doos ninsã kõbg fãa ye (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ).\n\nDoaag a tãab soabã: yaa arzãnã baoob kosgo, la zãag n yi Bugmã, yẽ me la lɩslaam fãa bõn-baoodgã la a tʋʋmã fãa yõodã (m Soab A Wẽnde, m kot-F-la arzãnã) la m kot pʋɩɩr paoong ne-a (la bũmb ning sẽn na n pẽneg arzãnã sẽn yaa gomde, maa tʋʋmde) tʋʋm sõms sẽn yard Foom (la m kot-F gũudum n yi Bugmã), bala gũud ka be n yi tʋʋm wẽnsã sã n ka Fo nimbãan zoεεga (la bũmb ning sẽn pẽnegd maam ne Bugmã, sẽn yaa gomde, maa tʋʋmde) sẽn yaa Wẽnd kɩɩsg tʋʋmã sẽn gẽed Foom A Wẽnde.\n\nDoos a naas soabã: yaa kos yarda ne Wẽnd Bʋʋdã (la m kot-F tɩ bʋʋd fãa F sẽn bʋ mam zug bɩ yɩ sõma ne-ma) la yell fãa Wẽnd sẽn bʋ bɩ A maan-a t'a yɩ sõma ne-ma, la wãnde bee kos Wẽnd t'a mɑɑn-f tɩ f yar Wẽnd Bʋʋdã pʋgẽ.",
    "hints": [
          "Wilgdame tɩ ned sõmb n karem a zak rãmba bũmb ning sẽn na n naf-ba, sẽn yaa dĩinã la dũni wã yεla, wala Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) sẽn karem a ʿAaɩšã wã.",
          "Sẽn sõmb n yɩɩd ne lɩslaam yaa a ruls doos nins sẽn wa tɩ yi Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) nengẽ wã, bala a doosã yaa sẽn gũbg goam wʋsgo.",
          "Bãngdbã yeela hadiis-kãngã zugu: yãwã yaa hadiis sẽn tʋg n gũbg n yɩɩda, sã n yaa ne sõma kosgo la kos gũudum n yi wẽnga, rẽnd a bee Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) gom-tigimdi nins Wẽnd sẽn kõ-a wã.",
          "Sẽn be sabab-rãmb nins sẽn kẽesd ned arzãnã, Wẽnd yolsgã poorẽ, yaa tʋʋm sõmsã la goam sõmsã.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "رواه ابن ماجه وأحمد",
  },
  5488: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "M Soab A Wẽnde, m kot-F-la gũudum n yi Fo neemã wã wa gõbg n bas-ma la Fo laafɩ wã wa wẽnems m bas-ma, la Fo sɩbgrã lingri, la Fo gẽegã fãa",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAbdʋllaah ɭbn ʿƲmar nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga), a yeelame: rag n bee Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã kosgã pʋgẽ, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ): «M Soab A Wẽnde, m kot-F-la gũudum n yi Fo neemã wã wa gõbg n bas-ma la Fo laafɩ wã wa wẽnems m bas-ma, la Fo sɩbgrã lingri, la Fo gẽegã fãa».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) kosa gũudum n yi yεl a naase:\n\nRẽenemã: (M Soab A Wẽnde, m kot-F-la gũudum n yi Fo neemã wã wa gõbg n bas-ma) sẽn yaa dĩini la dũni, tɩ m tablg m meng ne lɩslaangã la m zãag m meng ne lʋɩ Wẽnd kɩɩsg pʋgẽ sẽn yẽesd neemã wã.\n\nYiib soabã: (la n yi Fo laafɩ wã wa wẽnemse) ne Fo sẽn na n toeem-a n kẽng baollego, rẽnd m kot-F lame tɩ F duum m laafɩ wã, la m tɩlg n yi nangã la bãasã.\n\nTãab soabã: (la n yi Fo sɩbgrã lingri) zem tɩ yaa ballego maa Wẽnd kɩɩsgo, rẽnd nangã la sɩbgrã sã n ling n wa, wakat ka leb n be n tõe n maan tuubg la paam n maneg ye, tɩ rẽnda masɩɩbã keelem n yɩɩde.\n\nNaas soabã: (la n yi Fo gẽegã fãa) la sabab nins sẽn maand tɩ Fo gẽegã yɩ wã, ad Foom Wẽnd sẽn gẽ a soaba, a bõn yã la a konge.\n\nLa Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) waa ne gom-bil sẽn tigme sẽn na yɩl tɩ gũbg Wẽnd gẽegã sabab-rãmbã gilli (A Naam yɩlg n zẽke) sẽn yaa gomã la tʋʋmã la loeesã.",
    "hints": [
          "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) sẽn tar tʋlsem n tʋg a Soabã nengẽ (A Naam zẽk yã).",
          "La kos gũudum-kãngã a gũbga sẽn tara barkã a tigma: paam segl sõng n pʋʋs neemã wã barka, la f gũus f menga n ra lʋɩ Wẽnd kɩɩsg pʋgẽ ye; bala a yẽesda neemã wã.",
          "Yaa maan nonglem n zãag zĩig ning Wẽnd sẽn gẽ wã, (A Naam zẽk yã).",
          "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) kosa gũudum n yi Wẽnd sɩbgrã lingri (A Naam zẽk yã), bala A sã n na n nams yamba, rẽnd masɩɩb a sẽn pa tõe n tus-a n sig a zug, pa tõe tus-a me ne bõn-naandsã sõgre ye, baa tɩ b fãa tigim taaba.",
          "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) sẽn kos gũudum n yi Wẽnd sẽn kõ laafɩ wã toeengo, (A Naam yɩlg n zẽke); bala Wẽnd sã n kõ-a laafɩ, rẽnd a paama dũni la laahɩr pʋɩɩre, la a sã n wẽnems n bas-a, ad b sɩbg-a ne dũni la laahɩr wẽnga, bala laafɩ paoongo dĩinã ne dũni wã manegr be ne rẽ.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
