  5489: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "M Soab A Wẽnde, m kot-F-la gũudum n yi samd wilbu, la bε wilbu, la bεεb laada",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAbdʋllaah ɭbn ʿAmr ɭbn Al-ʿaaṣ nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga), tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋm, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) rag n yɩɩme n kot ne goam-kãensã: «M Soab A Wẽnde, m kot-F-la gũudum n yi samd wilbu, la bε wilbu, la bεεb laada».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) kosa Wẽnd gũudum n yi yεla:\n\nRẽenemã: (M Soab A Wẽnde, m kot-F-la gũudum) la m lebsd m menga Fo nengẽ, ka zẽng sẽn ka Foom, (n yi samd wilbu) la a modgre la a yɩɩgre la a pεta, la m kot-F sõngre sẽn na yɩl n paam n yao samdã.\n\nYiib soabã: (la bε wilbu) la a modgre la a weoogre, la m kot-F-la gũudum tɩ F tus a nangã n bas-ma, la m tõog-a.\n\nTãab soabã: (la bεεb laada) la b sũ-noogr maaneg ne masɩɩb sẽn paam lɩslaamã.",
    "hints": [
          "Hadiisã kengdame tɩ b kos Wẽnd gũudun n yi bũmb fãa sẽn maan soagl n yit tũudmã la a wat ne yɩɩgre, wala samde la zẽng sẽn ka rẽ.",
          "Samd mengã yell ka a pʋgẽ ye, la yellã yaa ned ning sẽn ka tara n na n yao samdã, yẽnda la samdã sẽn wilã.",
          "Ninsaal sõmb n zãaga a meng ne yεl nins b sẽn tõe tʋ-a ne-a la b zang-a ne-a.",
          "Wilgda kɩfr-rãmbã beemã sẽn be ne sɩd-kõtbã la b sẽn tʋʋd-ba masɩɩb-rãmbã paoong sasa.",
          "Bεεbã sẽn vẽnegd b sũ-noog ne ninsaalã tɩ yell sã n paam-a, a namesda neda n yɩɩd yellã mengã.",
        ],
