    "hadeeth": "Yii ɑ Abɩɩ Hʋrɑyrɑt nengẽ -Wẽnd yɑrd be ɑ yĩngɑ- ɑ yeelɑme: Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeelame-: Gom-biis a yiibu n be, n yaa faasg ne zelemdã, n yaool n yaa zɩsgo, tʋʋm peesg laok zugu, tɩ b yiibã noom Arrahmaan Naaba: yaa (Sʋbhaana-llaah Al-azɩɩm,) la (Sʋbhaana-llaah wa bihamdihii).",
