    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAaɩša nengẽ -Wẽnd yarde be a yĩnga- sẽn yaa Nabiyaamã pagã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), tɩ yii Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋm nengẽ, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeelame: «Ad bʋg-bʋg ka zĩndid bũmb pʋgẽ rẽndame t'a nags-a, b ka kongd-a bũmb pʋgẽ me rẽndame t'a zang-a».",
