          "Zʋg-sõngo a bee sabab-rãmb nins sẽn maand tɩ nebã nong taaba, la zʋg-wẽngã yaa woto tulli.",
          "Yaa kengr tɩ b maan sõma n tʋg bõn-naandsã la b gãneg b menga, la b ra maan pãng la rogl-m-meng ye.",
          "A bugsdame tɩ b bas goama, tɩ yaa sẽn na wʋsg bala, la waoog-m-meng la zɩsgr la tʋk-m-meng f sẽn ka tõe.",
