    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kõta kibare, tɩ Wẽnde -A Naam yɩ wagell n zẽke- A yeelame: Adam biiga, yãk n nafe, nafa nins sẽn zao fo zugã la b sẽn bʋ nonglemã- tɩ Mam na yalg f rɩtlã la M kõ-fo ledsgo n yɩɩd rẽnda la M maan barka.",
