    "title": "Tẽegd-y Alkʋrãan-kãngã, tɩ mam wẽenda ne a Mohammad yõorã sẽn be Naab ning nugẽ wã, ad Alkʋrãanã n yɩɩd fãagr ne yʋgemd sẽn be a baarẽ",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Muusa Al-aš'ʿary nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga),  tɩ yii Nɑbiyɑɑmã nengẽ, -Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ- a yeelame: «Tẽegd-y Alkʋrãan-kãngã, tɩ mam wẽenda ne a Mohammad yõorã sẽn be Naab ning nugẽ wã, ad Alkʋrãanã n yɩɩd fãagr ne yʋgemd sẽn be a baarẽ».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) saglame tɩ b minimis Alkʋrãanã la b tablag a karengo, sẽn na yɩlẽ n ra wa yĩm-a, fo sẽn rag n ruls-a f yãoogẽ wã poorẽ, la a keng rẽndã ne a sẽn wẽene, tɩ Alkʋrãanã, yẽnda fãagre la a loogr n bas a soaba, a keelmã yɩɩda yʋgemde b sẽn sẽb ne wĩiri, a soabã sã n get a yelle, a paamd-a lame, la a sã n lok-a n base la a sẽn loogd n meneme.",
    "hints": [
