    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿƲsmaan nengẽ -Wẽnd yard be ɑ yĩngɑ- tɩ yii Nabiyaamã nengẽ -Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ- a yeelame : «Yãmb sõma sẽn yɩɩda soaba, yaa ned ning sẽn karem Alkʋrãanã la a wilg-a».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kõta kibare, tɩ lɩslaambã sẽn yɩɩd sõmblem, la b sẽn yɩɩd dargε zẽkr Wẽnd nengẽ: yaa ned ning sẽn karema Alkʋrãanã, karengo, la rulsgu, la fasengo, la tafsɩɩre (welsgo), la a wilg a to bũmb ning sẽn be yẽ nengẽ, sẽn yaa Alkʋrãanã bãngre, n lagem ne yẽ sẽn tʋm ne-a wã.",
