  5934: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "M ka na n tʋms foom bũmb ning yĩnga, Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) sẽn tʋms maam ne bũmb ningã? Tɩ f ra bas nin-naande rẽndame tɩ f saram-a, la f ra bas yaoog sẽn zẽke, rẽndame tɩ f zẽms a taaba",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Al-Hayyag Al-asady nengẽ, a yeelame: A Ali ɭbn Abɩɩ Ṭaalib yeela maam: M ka na n tʋms foom bũmb ning yĩnga, Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) sẽn tʋms maam ne bũmb ningã? Tɩ f ra bas nin-naande rẽndame tɩ f saram-a, la f ra bas yaoog sẽn zẽke, rẽndame tɩ f zẽms a taaba.",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) a ra yɩɩme n tʋmd a Ṣahaabsã, tɩ b ra bas \"nin-naande\"- yẽ me la bũmb ning b sẽn maan ne yõor tɩ yaa vɩta, zem tɩ b maan-a lame t'a tar yĩnga, maa a ka tar yĩnga- rẽndame tɩ b yẽes-a.\n\nLa b ra bas yaoog sẽn zẽk ye, rẽndame tɩ zems-a ne tẽngã, la b wã bũmb ning sẽn be a zug sẽn yaa meoongã, maa b maan-a t'a zems ne tẽnga, n ka zẽk ye, rẽndame tɩ yaa bilf bala, b tõe n zẽk-a-la ne tẽngã sẽn yaa wala kãntɩɩga.",
    "hints": [
          "Wilgdame tɩ yaa haraam tɩ b sʋʋr yõyã rãmbã, bala a yaa sabab-rãmb nins sẽn tõe n kẽes lagem-n-taare.",
          "Yaa sãri wã sẽn kõ sor tɩ b tõe n kɩɩs yel-kitg ne nugu, ne ned ning sẽn tara naam maa tõog ne rẽ.",
          "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) sẽn tar yã-beedo, n na n yẽes bũmb fãa gill sẽn tar tõkr ne Zɩɩlmã sasa vũuna, sẽn yaa fot-rãmbã (sʋʋrgo) la nin-naandse la yaadã zutã meebo.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A Muslim n togs-a",
  },
  5936: {
