  6179: {
    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "Fighu wã ne Yẽgã",
    "title": "Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), ra yɩɩme n yɩɩd nebã ne kũuni, la a kũunã sẽn tʋg n yɩɩda, yaa Ramadaan pʋgẽ, a sẽn wat n yeka a Gibriila",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ɭbn ʿAbbaas nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga), a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), ra yɩɩme n yɩɩd nebã ne kũuni, la a kũunã sẽn tʋg n yɩɩda, yaa Ramadaan pʋgẽ, a sẽn wat n yeka a Gibriila, a rag n yɩɩme n yekd-a Ramadaanã yʋng fãa n karemd-a Alkʋrãanã, rẽnd Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) a rag n kõtame n yɩɩd seb fugdga.",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), ra yɩɩme n yɩɩd nebã ne kũuni, la a kũunã sẽn tʋg n yɩɩda, yaa Ramadaan pʋgẽ, n kɩt t'a kõt bũmb ning sẽn sõmbe ne ned ning sẽn sõmbe, la a kũunã paasg sabab yaa yεl a yiibu:\n\nRẽenem: yaa a segbã ne a Gibriila (tɩlgr be a yĩnga).\n\nYell ɑ to wã: Yaa Alkʋrãanã karengã, la yẽnda yaa rulsg ne zugu.\n\nT'a Gibriil (Tɩlgr be a yĩnga) karemd-a bũmb ning sẽn sigã gilli Alkʋrãanã pʋga, tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) a rag n kõtame n yɩɩda, la a maan sõmã n yɩɩda, la a yɩɩd yãgbo ne bõn-naandsã nafgo, n yɩɩd seb-noog ning Wẽnd sẽn tʋmsd-ɑ ne sakoomã la yolsgã.",
    "hints": [
          "Yaa Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kũunã vẽnegre, la sẽn yɩɩd fãa Ramadaanã pʋgẽ, bɑlɑ a yaa tũudum kiuugu la yel-sõm-rãmb wakato.",
          "Yaa pirsg n tʋg kũuni wakat fãa, la b maana a paasgã nonglem Ramadaanã pʋgẽ.",
          "Wilgdame tɩ b wʋsg nidg pãnga la kũuni la manegre, la Alkʋrãanã karengo, Ramadaanã kiuug pʋgẽ.",
          "Wilgdame tɩ bãngrã rulsg sabab-rãmbã, yaa a karengo ne karen-biisã la bãngdbã.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "B zemsa taab a zugu (A Al-Bʋẖaariy la a Muslim n reeg-a)",
  },
