  6211: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "Mam sẽn na n yeel (Sʋbhaana-llaah) la (Al-hamdu lillaah) la (Laa ɩlaaha ɩllallaah) la (Allaahʋ akbarʋ) yẽ n noom maam n yɩɩd bũmb fãa wĩndgã sẽn puk n miki",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Hʋrayrat nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeelame: «Mam sẽn na n yeel (Sʋbhaana-llaah) la (Al-hamdu lillaah) la (Laa ɩlaaha ɩllallaah) la (Allaahʋ akbarʋ) yẽ n noom maam n yɩɩd bũmb fãa wĩndgã sẽn puk n miki».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kõta kibare tɩ ad Wẽnd yʋʋrã tẽegrã -A Naam zẽk yã- ne gom-bi-kãensã sẽn yaa zɩsdã, a sõmblemã n yɩɩd dũni wã la sẽn be dũni wã pʋgẽ, bãmb me la:\n\n\"Sʋbhaana-llaah\": sẽn yaa yɩlgr ne Wẽnde n yi boogre.\n\n\"Al-hamdu lillaah\": yaa Wẽnd pẽgre ne sɩfa sẽn pidi, n lagem ne A nonglem la A zɩsgre.\n\n\"Laa ɩlaaha ɩllallaah\": b sẽn tũud a soab ne sɩd ka be, sã n ka Wẽnde.\n\n\"Allaahʋ akbarʋ\": Yẽ n zɩse, la A zẽk n yɩɩd bũmbã fãa gilli.",
    "hints": [
          "Yaa kengr tɩ b tẽeg Wẽnd yʋʋrã, la ad yẽnda n noom-a n yɩɩd bũmb fãa wĩndgã sẽn puk a zugu.",
          "Yaa sẽn pirsd tɩ b wʋsg Wẽnd yʋʋrã tẽegre, keoorã la yɩɩdlemã sẽn be beenẽ wã yĩnga.",
