    "hadeeth": "Yii a Bʋrayda ɭbn Al-haṣɩɩb nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: Yãg-y n pʋʋs Laasare, tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeelame: «Ned ning sẽn basa Laasar Pʋʋsgo, a tʋʋm lʋɩɩme»",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga)bugsame tɩ b ra wa yaoolg Laasar Pʋʋsg n yi a wakatã ye, pʋ-toog yĩng ye, la ned ning sẽn maana rẽnda, a tʋʋmã sãamame n lebg zaalem.",
