  6389: {
    "category_id": 7,
    "category": "Nɑbiyɑɑmã vɩɩmã togsg lɑ kʋdmdã kibɑy",
    "title": "B ka kɩt tɩ Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yãk yεl a yiib sʋka, rẽndame t'a yãk sẽn yɩɩda naanã wã soabã, tɩ zũnuub sã n ka be a pʋgẽ, la zũnuub sã n be a pʋgẽ, a rag n yɩɩme n yɩɩd nebã ne a zãagre",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAaɩša sẽn yaa muumin-rãmbã ma wã nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame: B ka kɩt tɩ Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yãk yεl a yiib sʋka, rẽndame t'a yãk sẽn yɩɩda naanã wã soabã, tɩ zũnuub sã n ka be a pʋgẽ, la zũnuub sã n be a pʋgẽ, a rag n yɩɩme n yɩɩd nebã ne a zãagre, la Tẽn-tʋʋmã ka maan n rol a meng yĩnga (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) sã n ka mikame tɩ b pãrga Wẽnd todsã, wakat-kãnga a maand n rola Wẽnd yĩnga.",
    "explanation": "Muumin-rãmbã ma wã, a Aaɩsa (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a kõo kibare sẽn kẽed ne Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) zʋgd-rãmb sãnda, la be a sẽn togsã pʋga: tɩ b ka kɩt tɩ Tẽn-tʋʋmã yãk yεl a yiib sʋka, rẽndame t'a yãk sẽn yɩɩda naanã wã soabã, tɩ zũnuub sã n ka be a pʋgẽ, la zũnuub sã n be a pʋgẽ, a rag n yɩɩme n yɩɩd nebã ne a zãagre, wakat-kãngã a yãkda toog sẽn yɩɩd a soabã. Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) ka maan n rol a meng yĩng ye, la ad a maanda bas-tɩ-looge, la a yaafd n bas a hakε, rẽndame tɩ sã n mikame tɩ b yõsga Wẽnd todsã, t'a yɩ n maan n rol Wẽnd yĩnga, la a ra yɩɩda nebã ne gẽeg Wẽnd yĩnga.",
    "hints": [
          "Wilgdame tɩ b bʋʋ nonglem tɩ b gãd yel naanã wã, sã n ka mikame tɩ Wẽnd kɩɩsg n be beenẽ.",
