          "Wilgda Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) sẽn da be bũmb ning zugã, sẽn yaa zʋg-bʋgsg la sugr la yik ne hakε wã, Wẽnd todsã yalsg zugu (A Naam zẽk yã).",
          "A ɭbn Hagar yeelame (Wẽnd na yols-a): be a pʋgẽ sẽn yaa bas yel-toogo, la sek f meng ne yel-naana, la kengr basgo tɩlae sẽn ka be zĩig ning pʋgẽ wã.",
          "Yaa pirsg tɩ b maan yaafa, rẽnda Wẽnd hakε-rãmbã pʋgẽ (A Naam zẽk yã).",
