          "Sẽn togs sõorã ka rat n na n yeel tɩ yaa woto tεk bal ye, la ad a wilgda lɩɩmaoongã tʋʋm sẽn yaa wʋsgo, bala Laarab-rãmbã b tõe n togsa bũmb sõore, la b ka rat n na n yeel t'a zẽng ka kẽed ye.",
