    "title": "Ned ning sẽn yẽsɑ tɩ mɑɑm n yeele, n neẽ t'a yaa zĩri, rẽnd nin-kãng naaga zĩri-be-nebã",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Samʋra ɭbn Gʋndab la a Al-Mʋgɩɩra ɭbn Šʋʿʋbat nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga), b yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma yeelame (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga): «Ned ning sẽn yẽsɑ tɩ mɑɑm n yeele, n neẽ t'a yaa zĩri, rẽnd nin-kãng naaga zĩri-be-nebã».",
