  },
  8289: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "Yolsdbã, Arrahmaan Naab na n yols-b lame, yols-y sẽn be b tẽngã, tɩ sẽn be a saasẽ wã na n yolsa yãmba",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAbdʋllaah ɭbn ʿAmr nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga) tɩ Nabiyaamã, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeelame: «Yolsdbã, Arrahmaan Naab na n yols-b lame, yols-y sẽn be b tẽngã, tɩ sẽn be a saasẽ wã na n yolsa yãmba».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) vẽnegdame, tɩ neb nins sẽn yolsd b taaba, Arrahmaan Naab na n yols-b-la ne A yolsg ning sẽn gũbg bũmbã fãa gillã; tɩ yaa yolsg sẽn zems yẽ tʋʋm sõngã.\n\nRẽ poorẽ, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) saglame, tɩ b yols sẽn be b tẽngã fãa gilli, sẽn yaa ninsaala la rũm-mugsi, la bõn-yɩgdɩ, la sẽn ka rẽnda, sẽn yaa bõn-naandsã kõbg toor-toore, la yẽ rolbo yaa tɩ Wẽnd na n yols-b lame sẽn yi A saasã zugu.",
    "hints": [
          "Yaa tɩ Lɩslaangã dĩinã, a yaa yolsg dĩini, a fãa gillã me tii Wẽnd tũudum zugu, lɑ manegr n tʋg bõn-naandsã.",
          "Wẽnde, (A Naam yɩ wagell n zẽke), b sɩfd-A lame ne Yolsgo, la Yẽ (A Naam yɩlgame), lɑ A Arrahmaan Nɑɑbɑ la A yolsg Nɑɑbɑ, Yẽ n taasd yolsgã A yembsã nengẽ.",
          "Wilgdame tɩ rolbã, a na n yɩɩ wala tʋʋmdã buudu, rẽnd yolsdbã Wẽnd yolsd-b lame.",
        ],
