  },
  8349: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "Ad sɩd-kõt tara arzãnã pʋgẽ zãnd sẽn yaa sãnem sẽn yaa gõko, sẽn tar pʋga, a woglemã yaa Miil pis-yoobe (kilo kobg la zaka), sɩd-kõt tara zak rãmb beenẽ, tɩ b gilgd a nengẽ, tɩ b ka ne taab ye",
