    "hadeeth": "Yii a Anas nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeelame: «Yãmb ned fãa sã n yõg koom n ning a na-wʋʋdo bɩ a pʋʋs ne-ba la a saag b yiibã n pʋʋse, la rẽ poorẽ a rɑ yãk b yiibã t'a sã n tʋlla, sã n ka gεnaab sababo».",
