    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) bugsda ned ning sẽn wa n yεεla nin-zẽnga: fo yaa dĩin yita, maa fo yaa kɩfre. Sã n mikame t'a soabã ka woto, rẽnd yɩta yẽnd n sõmb ne sɩf ning yẽ sẽn sɩfã, tɩ yẽ gomdã lebg n wa yẽ zugu, la sã n mikame t'a yaa wala yẽ sẽn yeelã, baa fʋɩ ka lebgd n wa yẽ zugu, bala yaa sɩd la a sẽn togs-a.",
