    "hadeeth": "Yii a Gεεbr nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be ɑ yĩngɑ) ɑ yeelɑme: m wʋma Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) t'ɑ yetẽ: «Ad a sʋɩɩtãan wãaaga a tẽeb tɩ Pʋʋsdb wa tʋg n tũ-a Laarab-rãmbã zamãanẽ, la a na n kẽesa mo-yõsr b sʋka».",
