    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAaɩša sẽn yaa muumin-rãmbã ma wã nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame: T'a Ʋmmu Habiiba Bint Gehš sẽn rag n yaa ʿAbdʋr-rahmaan pagã, a togsa Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) zɩɩmã sẽn paamd yẽnda, t'a yeel-a:  «Zĩndi, fo Pekrã sẽn rag gɩd foomã tεka, rẽ poorẽ, rasem-kãensã sã n loog bɩ f so». Rẽnd a ra yɩɩme n sood koom Pʋʋsg fãa wakato.",
    "explanation": "Sahaab poak a yembr tʋg n togsa Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) zɩɩmã sẽn kelled n yit n be ne-a, t'a sagl-a t'a bas Pʋʋsgã n zems yẽ Haydã sẽn rag n wãagdã tεka taoor tɩ yel-kãngã na n ka sɩngã, rẽ poorẽ bɩ a so koom la a pʋʋse, rẽnd a rag n yɩɩme n soodẽ, tɩ yaa yẽ yam-yãkre, wakat fãa gill pʋgẽ.",
    "hints": [
          "Kaadgã (bãagã): yaa zɩɩmã yiib sẽn na n kell n duum ne paga, a haydã rasem-rãmbã sẽn sε poorẽ.",
          "Kaad poak soaba, a geenda a menga t'a yaa Pekr soaba rasem nins yẽ sẽn minim n yãt Haydã alkadre, taoor tɩ bũmb ning sẽn paam yẽndã, b sẽn boond tɩ kaadgã na n ka paam-a wã.",
          "A rasem nins yẽ sẽn da minim n yãtẽ wã sã n looge, rẽnd geendame t'a yaa yɩlgemd n yi Pekre, -baa tɩ kaadg zɩɩm sã n ket n be ne-a-, rẽnd a sooda Pekrã wãagr koom.",
          "Kaad poaka, ka tɩlae ne-a t'a so koom Pʋʋsg fãa gill wakat ye, bala Sahaab poakã soob woto wã (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), yɩɩme tɩ yaa nidg pãng sẽn yi yẽ nengẽ, sã n rag n yaa tɩlae, Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) rag n na vẽneg n wilgame.",
          "Kaad poaka yaa tɩlae ne-a t'a yõk koom Pʋʋsg fãa gilli, bala yẽnda rẽgdã yiib yaa sẽn duumdi, ka wãagd ye, a bilg-n-taar yaa wala ned sẽn tar rẽgd tɩ yit a nengẽ wakat fãa, wala rʋʋd sẽnese maa rʋʋd ko-yondo, maa sẽed sẽn yit n duumdẽ.",
          "Sok bãngdbã bũmb ning sẽn gẽdg ne foom dĩinã yεlẽ, ne sẽn mik tɩ pʋg-kãngã a togsa Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) a yellã, la a leb n sok-a zɩ-wʋsg ning sẽn paam yẽndã bʋʋd sẽn yaa a soaba.",
