  10036: {
    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "Fighu wã ne Yẽgã",
    "title": "Koom soob arzũn raarã yaa tɩlae ne baalik fãa, la a wãb sɩgdre la a ning yũ-noogo t'a sã n paame",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAmr ɭbn Sʋlaym, Madiin neda, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame: m maanda kaseto t'a Abɩɩ Saʿɩɩd yeelame t'a maana kaset tɩ :Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) yeelame: «Koom soob arzũn raarã yaa tɩlae ne baalik fãa, la a wãb sɩgdre la a ning yũ-noogo t'a sã n paame».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) vẽnegdame n wilgdẽ, tɩ koom soob arzũm raarã, yaa bũmb sẽn kenge, t'a yaa wala waagib ne rao fãa sẽn yaa baalika, sẽn yaa arzũmã sẽn yaa tɩlae n rog b rãmb zutã, la a yɩlg a yẽnã ne sɩgdre la sẽn wõnd rẽ, la a ning yũ-noog sẽn yaa a soab fãa.",
    "hints": [
          "B bʋʋ nonglem tɩ kenge, ne arzũm koom soobo, ne rao fãa sẽn yaa lɩslaam, n yaa baalika.",
          "Yɩlgrã la yũ-yoodã yiisgu, a yaa bũmb b sẽn baood sãri wã pʋgẽ ne lɩslaama.",
          "Waoog arzũmã raare, la b seglg a yĩnga.",
          "B bʋʋ nonglem sẽn kenge, ne sɩgdre arzũm raare.",
          "B bʋʋ nonglem ne yũ-noog ningrã, sẽn wa n yaa yũ-noog ning fãa, sẽn yaa yɩlgemde, taoor tɩ na n ka kẽng arzũmã Pʋʋsgẽ ye.",
          "Pag sã n yi a sɩdã zakẽ n na n tʋg n pʋʋse, ka sakd ne-a t'a ning yũ-noog ye, ne Sunnah sẽn kengd tɩ rẽndã yaa haraam.",
          "Al-muhtalim (Zamsdã) yẽ la baalika, la baalikemdã paamda ne tagmas-rãmba, a tãabã raoa la pag fãa lagemda taaba beenẽ, la bãmbã me: rẽenem: yaa a sẽn na n pid yʋʋm piig la a nu, yiibu yaa pendã kõbd sẽn na n buli, tãab soaba: yaa mani sẽn na n yi ne zamsgo maa ne yamleoogo baa tɩ sã n ka tũ ne zamsgo. La sã n yaa tagmas a naas soaba, yẽnda welgda ne pag bala, yẽ la Pekrã, rẽnd pag sã n yã Haydo, a lebga baalika.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
