    "title": "Tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) a sã n rag n yi we-kεεnga, a yetame: «Gʋfraanak (M kot-F-la yaafa)",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAaɩša sẽn yaa muumim-rãmbã ma wã nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga): Tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) a sã n rag n yi we-kεεnga, a yetame: «Gʋfraanak (M kot-F-la yaafa)»..",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã rag n yɩɩme (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) t'a sã n yi a tʋlsem maaneg zĩigẽ, sẽn yaa we-kεεnga, a yetame: m kot-F-la (F yaafã) Wẽnde.",
