  10094: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "Kẽng ne mam neood a yiibã woto wã, tɩ fo sẽn sεg ned ning lal-kãngã poorẽ t'a maan kaset tɩ soab ka be tɩ sã n ka Wẽnde, n tar bãng-n-wãak ne a sũurã, bɩ f noog a sũur ne Arzãna",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Hʋrayrat nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame: Tõnd ra zĩime, Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋm kɩrengã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) la a Abuu Bakr ne a ʿƲmar ra beebe n lagem neb saare, tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yik n yi tõnd sʋka, n kaoos bilf n ka wa ye, tɩ tõnd yεεs tɩ b na n wa pas-a lame tɩ tõnd ka bãng ye, tɩ tõnd yiki, la maam la rẽenem ned sẽn bir n yiki, tɩ mam yi n baood Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) halɩ n tʋg n ta pʋʋg sẽn yaa Madiin rãmbã pʋʋgo, yaa Banii Nagεεr rãmba neda, tɩ mam gilg pʋʋgã, tɩ tõe tɩ m yã noor n tũ n kẽ, la m ka yã ye, la mam sẽn ne ko-sor sẽn tũud lalg (võore) n kẽed pʋʋg sʋka,   n yit pulg sẽn be yɩngã n watẽ, tɩ mam põd n menga n kẽ, n kẽng Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã nengẽ (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), t'a yeele: «Abaa hʋrayra» tɩ mam yeel: n-yee Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã, t'a yeele: «Yaa bõe n wa ne-fo?» Tɩ mam yeele: fo ra bee tõnd sʋka, n yiki la fo kaoosame, tɩ tõnd yεεs tɩ bũmb na n wa maan foom tɩ tõnd ka bãng ye, tɩ tõnd yεεge, la maam la rẽenem n yik n wa pʋʋgẽ wã n gilgdẽ, la mam põda wala waaga sẽn põt to-to wã n kẽ, la nebã bee mam poorẽ, tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeele: «Abaa Hʋrayra» la a rɩk a neod a yiibã n kõ maam n yeele: «Kẽng ne mam neood a yiibã woto wã, tɩ fo sẽn sεg ned ning lal-kãngã poorẽ t'a maan kaset tɩ soab ka be tɩ sã n ka Wẽnde, n tar bãng-n-wãak ne a sũurã, bɩ f noog a sũur ne Arzãna». La rẽenem ned mam sẽn sεg yaa a ʿƲmar, t'a yeele: yaa bõe neood a yiib la woto Abaa Hʋrayra? Tɩ mam yeele: Bãmbã b yiibã, yaa Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã neoodã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), a tʋmsa maam ne neood a yiibã, tɩ m sẽn sεg ned ning t'a maan kaset tɩ soab ka be tɩ sã n ka Wẽnde, n tar bãng-n-wãak ne a sũurã, bɩ m noog a sũur ne Arzãna. T'a ʿƲmar rɩk a nugã n wẽ mam yãoogã, tɩ m tar n lʋɩ m sεεgã zugu, n yeele: lebge Abaa Hʋrayrat, tɩ mam lebg n kẽng Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã nengẽ (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), n tʋg n kũmdẽ, t'a ʿƲmar pʋgl maam n wa, tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeele: «Yaa bõe n tar foom yaa Abaa Hʋrayra?» Tɩ mam yeele: m sεga a ʿƲmar n kõ-a kibar ne gomd ning fo sẽn tʋms maam ne wã, t'a wẽ mam yãoogã, tɩ mam  lʋɩ m kɩgbã zugu, la a yeel maam tɩ m lebge, tɩ  Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã yeele: (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) «ʿƲmar yaa bõe n kɩt tɩ fo maam woto?» La a yeel yã, Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, mam saamb la m ma rɩkd n yaoome n põsg fo yõorã, foom n tʋms a Abuu Hʋrayrat ne neood a yiibã, t'a sẽn sεg ned ning t'a maan kaset tɩ soab ka be tɩ sã n ka Wẽnde, n tar bãng-n-wãak ne a sũurã, bɩ a noog a sũur ne Arzãna? T'a yeele: «N-yee» T'a ʿƲmar yeele: bɩ f ra maan woto ye, tɩ ad mam yεεsda nebã na teeg rẽ, bas-b tɩ b tʋme, tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeele: «Bɩ f bas-b tʋ b tʋme».",
    "explanation": "Nɑbiyɑɑmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) ra yɩɩme n zĩẽ, zãmã pʋgẽ, sahaabsã sʋka, a Abuu Bakr la a ʿƲmar rag n bee beenẽ, la Nɑbiyɑɑmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yikame n kaoos n ka wa ye, tɩ b yεεs tɩ bũmb na n wa maan-a, wala bεεbã, maa b yõk-a maa zẽng sẽn ka rẽnda. Tɩ Sahaabsã (Wẽnd yard be b yĩnga) yiki, tɩ b yaa sẽn yεεse, la sẽn reng n yεεs n yikã, yaa a Abuu Hʋrayrat (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a tʋg n pɩʋʋga zẽed pʋʋg sẽn yaa Banii Nagεεd-rãmb pʋʋgo, n gilg tɩ sãnde a na yã ragnoor n kẽ, la a ka yã ye, la a yãa võor sẽn yaa kɩdg lalgẽ wã, tɩ koomã tũud bẽenẽ n kẽedẽ, t'a põd a yĩngã n paam n kẽ, n mik tɩ Nɑbiyɑɑmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) bee beenẽ, t'a yεεl-a: yaa foom a Abaa Hʋrayrat bɩɩ? La a yeele: n-yee. La a yeel yã: yaa bõe n tar foom? A Abuu Hʋrayrat yeele: fo ra bee tõnd sʋka, n yik la fo kaoosame tɩ tõnd yεεsd tɩ bũmb na n wa maan-f tɩ d ka bãng ye, la maam la rẽenem sẽn yεεse, tɩ mam wa gilgd pʋʋgã lalga, tɩ mam põd wala waag sẽn põtã, la nebã bee mam poorẽ. Tɩ Nɑbiyɑɑmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kõ-a a neood a yiibã, tɩ yaa sẽn wilgdi la tagmase t'a togsgã yaa sɩda, N yεεl-a: kẽng ne mam neoodã a yiibã, ned ning fo sẽn yek lal-kãngã poorẽ, n maan kaset tɩ \"laa ɩlaaha ɩllaa Allaah= soab sẽn na n tũ sɩd-sɩd ka be, sã n pa yɩ ne Wẽnde\" la b sẽn sõmb n tũ ne sɩd ka be rẽnda Wẽnde, t'a sũurã yaa sẽn bãng n wãag ne rẽ, ned ning sẽn wa n yaa woto, ad a yaa arzãn neda. La rẽenem mam sẽn seg yaa a ʿƲmar t'a yeele: yaa bõe neood a yiib la woto,  Abuu Harayrat? Tɩ mam yeel: bãmbã b yiibã yaa Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã neooda (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) a tʋmsa maam ne-ba, tɩ ned ninga m sẽn sege, t'a maam kaset tɩ : \"laa ɩlaaha ɩllaa Allaah= soab sẽn na n tũ sɩd-sɩd ka be, sã n pa yɩ ne Wẽnde\" n yaa sẽn bãng n wãag ne a sũurã, bɩ m kõ-a sũ-noogr ne arzãna. T'a ʿƲmar (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), wẽ a Abuu Hʋrayrat yãoogã, t'a lʋɩ a sẽegã zugu, n yεεl-a: Abuu Hʋrayrata, lebge, tɩ mam lebg n kẽng Nɑbiyɑɑmã nengẽ (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), tɩ mam yaa sẽn yεεse, tɩ mam nengã yaa sẽn toeeme, n rat n na n kũme, la a ʿƲmar pʋga maam n kẽn mam poorẽ wã n wa. Tɩ Nɑbiyɑɑmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeele: yaa bõe n tar foom Abaa Hʋrayrat? Tɩ maam yeele: m sega a ʿƲmar n kõ-a kibar ne gomd ning fo sẽn tʋms maam ne wã, t'a wẽ mam yãoogã, tɩ mam  lʋɩ m sẽengã zugu, la a yeel tɩ m lebge. Tɩ Nɑbiyɑɑmã yeele (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga): ʿƲmar, yaa bõe n kɩt tɩ fo maan woto? A ʿƲmar yeele: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, mam saamb la m ma rɩkd n yaoome n põsg fo yõorã, foom n tʋms a Abuu Hʋrayrat ne neood a yiibã, t'a sẽn seg ned ning t'a maan kaset tɩ soab ka be tɩ sã n ka Wẽnde, n tar bãng-n-wãak ne a sũurã, bɩ a noog a sũur ne arzãna? Nabiyaamã yeele: n-yee. A ʿƲmar yeele: Bɩ f ra maan woto ye, tɩ ad mam yεεsda nebã wa teeg rẽ, n ka tʋm ye, bas-b tɩ b tʋme. Tɩ Nɑbiyɑɑmã yeele (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga): sã n yaa woto bɩ f bas-ba.",
    "hints": [
          "Wilgda Sahaabsã nong-kεgenga (Wẽnd yard be b yĩnga) ne Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) la b sẽn leb n tar nong-kεgeng ne a tɩlg n yi yel-kisgd fãa.",
          "Wilgda b sẽn kõ sor tɩ b noog taab sũy ne kiba-noodo.",
          "Liimaoongã yaa gomd la tʋʋmd la loεεga.",
          "A Al-ƙaadiy ʿɭyyaad (Wẽnd na yols-a) la zẽng sẽn ka yẽ yeelame: a ʿƲmar tʋʋmdã (Wẽnd yard be a yinga) la a lebsd gomdã n baood yiib zĩig Nɑbiyɑɑmã nengẽ wã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) ka Nabiyaamã sagellã lebsg ye, bala bũmb ning b sẽn togs ne a Abuu Hʋrayratã (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) bũmb ka be sã n ka lɩslaambã zamã wã sũur noogr bal ye, t'a ʿƲmar (Wẽnd yard be a yinga) yãame tɩ yel-kãngã solgrã sõma n yɩɩde, yẽ n leb n pẽ ne b na tʋma la b ra teeg rẽ ye, yẽ n leb n yɩɩd b na yɩlem sõmã wã maanego, n yɩɩd ne b noog b sũur ne yel-sõmd-kãngã, la a sẽn wa n ball a raabã ne Nɑbiyɑɑmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) a sɩd sakame t'a gomdã yaa sɩda.",
          "An-nawawiy (Wẽnd na yols-a) a yeelame: hadiis-kãngã pʋgẽ, bee beenẽ ne limaam kãsenga, a tõeeme, a sã n yã bũmbu, t'a pʋgdbã sãnda yã bũmb a to, sõmba ne pʋgdbã tɩ b rɩk-a n ball taoor soabã, t'a gese, pʋgdbã sẽn yeelã sã n vẽneg ne-a tɩ rẽ la sɩda, a lebgd n maana rẽ, la sã n ka rẽ, a vẽnegdame n wilg pʋgdã bũmb ning yẽ sẽn ka fahemd zãnga.",
          "Wilgdame tɩ b tõe n yõkame n bas bãngr sãnda sãeegre, tʋlsem sẽn ka be a pʋgẽ, tɩ yaa manegr baoob yĩnga, maa sãang yεεsg yĩnga.",
          "Sũ-noogr sẽn yaa bedre be ne Wẽn-yemdbã la ned ning sẽn maana kaalem, tɩ yẽ yaa sẽn maan kaset tɩ: \"laa ɩlaaha ɩllaa Allaah= soab sẽn na n tũ sɩd-sɩd ka be, sã n pa yɩ ne Wẽnde\" n welg toor a sũurẽ wã, a tara arzãna.",
          "Wilgda a ʿƲmar pãnga (Wẽnd yard be a yinga) la a gom minimã la a bãngrã yalem.",
          "A An-nawawiy (Wẽnd na yols-a) a yeelame: wilgdame tɩ ned tõeeme n kẽ a to soolem pʋga, tɩ ka tũ ne a sor kũun ye, t'a sã n bãng tɩ rẽnda yard-a lame, nonglem sẽn be bãmb b yiibã ne taab sʋk yĩnga, maa zẽng sẽn ka woto.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A Muslim n togs-a",
  },
  10098: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "Ned ka be, n maan kaset tɩ (laa ɩlaaha ɩllal-Allaah, wa ɑnna Mʋhammadan rasʋʋllaah) = (M maanda kaset tɩ soab hakɩɩk pa be rẽnda Wẽnde, la m maand kaset t'a Mʋhammad yaa Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma) n kõ sɩda a sũurẽ wã, rẽndame tɩ Wẽnd harm-a ne Bugmã",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Anas ɭbn Maalik nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga): Tɩ Nɑbiyɑɑmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) la a Mʋ'ʿaaz rag n zao Nabiyaamã poorẽ, a rũngã zugu, t'a bool-a n yeele: « Yaa a Mʋ'ʿaaz ɭbn Gεbale» t'a Mʋ'ʿaaz yeele: (Labbayka yaa rasʋʋlʋllaah wa sa'ʿadayka= m sak-fo, m sɑk f yĩngɑ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma), noor a tãabo. Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋm yeele: «Ned ka be, n maan kaset tɩ (laa ɩlaaha ɩllal-Allaah, wa ɑnna Mʋhammadan rasʋʋllaah) = (M maanda kaset tɩ soab hakɩɩk pa be rẽnda Wẽnde, la m maand kaset t'a Mʋhammad yaa Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma) n kõ sɩda a sũurẽ wã, rẽndame tɩ Wẽnd harm-a ne Bugmã». Rẽ poorẽ, a Mʋ'ʿaaz yeelame : Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, rẽ yĩnga, m ka na n kõ nebã kiba-noogo, sẽn na yɩlẽ tɩ b kɩdme la b noog b sũur ne Wẽnd kũun-kãnga? Tɩ Nabiyaamã yeele: «fo sã n maan woto, b na n wa teega rẽndã». La a Mʋ'ʿaaz togsa kibarã, a kũumã sasa, a sẽn yεεsd t'a na n wa paam zũnuub yĩnga t'a sã n solge.",
    "explanation": "A Mʋ'ʿaaz ɭbn Gεbal rag n yɩɩme, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), n zao Nɑbiyɑɑmã poorẽ (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), a rũngã zugu, t'a bool-a n yeele, yaa a Mʋ'ʿaaze, la a yɩlma a boollã noor a tãabo, tɩ yaa sẽn na n keng bũmb ning a sẽn na n yeelã sẽn ta zĩig ninga.\n\nLa rẽ fãa, a Mʋ'ʿaaz -Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga, rag n sakdame, n yetẽ: «labbayka yaa rasʋʋlʋllaah wa sa'ʿadayka», rat n yeele: m sak-fo, Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), m sok f yĩnga, tɩ yaa sakr sẽn pʋgd taaba, m leb n baooda zu-noogo fo sakrã yĩnga.\n\nTɩ Nɑbiyɑɑmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kõ-a kibare, tɩ ad ned ka be n na n maan kaseto tɩ (laa ɩlaaha ɩllal-Allaah= soab sẽn na n tũ n tɩlg ka be, rẽnda Wẽnde), la (Mʋhammadan rasʋʋllaah= la a Mʋhammad yaa Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã) tɩ yaa sɩda a sũurẽ wã, n ka zĩri-beedo, a sã n maan kaalem halhaal-kãngã zugu, Wẽnd haramda Bugmã a yĩnga.\n\nT'a Mʋ'ʿaaz (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) sok Nɑbiyɑɑmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) t'a na n togsa nebã tɩ b sũyã yɩ noogo la b kɩdem ne yel-sõmdã?\n\nTɩ Nɑbiyɑɑmã  yεεse (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) tɩ nebã na n wa teega rẽndã tɩ b tʋʋmã yɩ bilfu.\n\nT'a Mʋ'ʿaaz ka yẽs ned baa a yembre, sã n ka a kũumã sẽn wa n ta wã, a sẽn yεεsd tɩ yẽ na n wa tʋg n lʋɩɩ bãngr solgr zũnuub pʋgẽ.",
    "hints": [
          "Wilgda Nɑbiyɑɑmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) gãneg-m-menga, ne a sẽn rɩk a Mʋ'ʿaaz poorẽ wã, a rũngã zugã.",
          "Yaa Nɑbiyɑɑmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) wilgrã na-kẽndrã, ne a sẽn yɩlm a Mʋ'ʿaaz boollã sẽn na yɩ n nek-a t'a kelg neere, a sẽn na n togs-a wã.",
          "Sẽn be sahdã tɩ (laa ɩlaaha ɩllal-Allaah= soab sẽn na n tũ n tɩlg ka be, rẽnda Wẽnde), la (Mʋhammadan rasʋʋllaah= la a Mohammad yaa Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã), a yεtã yɩ sɩd soaba, n tar bãng-n-wãaka ne a sẽn yetã, ka zĩri-be-neda, ka sik maanda.",
          "Wẽn-yembdbã ka na n duum Gεhannem pʋgẽ ye, baa tɩ b sã n kẽ ne b zũnuub sababo, b na n yiis-b-la beenẽ, b sẽn yɩlg poorẽ, n tɩ kẽes-b arzãna.",
          "Yaa sahd a yiibã yɩɩdlem ning sẽn be a beenẽ, ne ned ning sẽn yeel-b ne sɩda.",
          "Yaa tɩ sakdame tɩ b bas hadiis sãnda togsgo, halhaal-rãmb sãnda pʋgẽ, tɩ sãang sã n na n zĩnd a zugu.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "B zemsa taab a zugu (A Al-Bʋẖaariy la a Muslim n reeg-a)",
  },
