    "title": "Lɩslaama yaa ned ning lɩslaambã sẽn tɩlg n yi a zelemde la a nugu, la muhaagɩrʋ (ned ning sẽn yik ne a dĩin n zoetẽ), yẽ la ned ning sẽn bas bũmb ning Wẽnd sẽn gɩdgã",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAbdʋllaah ɭbn ʿAmr nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga), a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) yeelame: «Lɩslaama yaa ned ning lɩslaambã sẽn tɩlg n yi a zelemde la a nugu, la muhaagɩrʋ (ned ning sẽn yik ne a dĩin n zoetẽ), yẽ la ned ning sẽn bas bũmb ning Wẽnd sẽn gɩdgã».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kõo tõnd kibare, tɩ lɩslaam sẽn pidi, yẽ yaa ned ning lɩslaambã sẽn paam n yi a zelemdã wẽnga, a ka tʋʋd-ba, a ka kãabd-ba, a ka wɩt-ba, a ka kẽnd b sʋk ne naong sẽn yaa kõbg ning fãa gill ne a zelemdã ye. la b leb n tɩlg n yi a nugã, t'a ka namsd-b ye, a ka reegd b arzεka tɩ ka tũ ne hakε, la sẽn wõnd rẽ, la muhaagɩrʋ (ned ning sẽn yik ne a dĩin n zoetẽ), yẽ la ned ning sẽn bas bũmb ning Wẽnd sẽn gɩdgã, (A Naam zẽkame).",
    "hints": [
          "Lɩslaangã pidb ka tõe n yɩ rẽndame tɩ f ra maan wẽng ne nebã, zem tɩ yaa vẽenega maa wẽng sẽn ka vẽenega.",
          "b welga zelemdã la nugã, bala bãmb b yiibã tudgrã la b wẽngã yaa wʋsgo, bala wẽngã wʋsg fãa yita bãmb nengẽ.",
          "A kengdame tɩ b bas Wẽnd kɩɩsgo, la b tabl A saglsã, (A Naam zẽk yã).",
