  10113: {
    "category_id": 1,
    "category": "Alkʋrãɑn wɑgellã ne ɑ Bãng-rãmbã",
    "title": "Ned sẽn mi Alkʋrãanã sõma, a bee ne mɑlεg-kãndbã sẽn yaa waglã, sẽn yaa manegdbã, la ned ning sẽn karemda Alkʋrãanã n maan bɩt-bɩt a pʋgẽ, tɩ yaa toog ne-a wã, a tara keoor a yiibu",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAaɩša nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã yeelame (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga): «Ned sẽn mi Alkʋrãanã sõma, a bee ne mɑlεg-kãndbã sẽn yaa waglã, sẽn yaa manegdbã, la ned ning sẽn karemda Alkʋrãanã n maan bɩt-bɩt a pʋgẽ, tɩ yaa toog ne-a wã, a tara keoor a yiibu».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kõo kibare, tɩ ned ning sẽn karemda Alkʋrãanã t'a rulsgã yaa sõma, n tõ-a sõma, t'a karengã yaa sõma, a tara keoor laahr raarã, t'a dargε wã na n lagema malεgs waglã. La ned ning sẽn karemda Alkʋrãanã n maand bɩt-bɩt a karengã pʋgẽ wã, a rulsgã sẽn yaa valeng yĩnga, la sẽn lagem ne rẽ fãa, a modgd n tar-a-la wakat fãa, tɩ yaa toog ne-a, yẽ soab tara keoor a yiibu: a karengã keoore, la musak ning sẽn paamda yẽndã karengã pʋgẽ wã keoore.",
    "hints": [
          "Pirsdame tɩ b ruls Alkʋrãanã la b maneg-a sõma la b karem-a wʋsgo, sẽn na yɩl n paam keoor la yel-sõmde, la b vẽneg n wilg ned ning sẽn maanda woto wã dargε sẽn zẽke.",
          "A Al-Ƙaaḍiy yeelame (Wẽnd na yols-a): la a maanã ka rat n na n yeel tɩ ned ning sẽn karemda bɩt-bɩtã a tara keoor n yɩɩd ned ning sẽn mi-a sõmã wã ye, la ad ned ning sẽn sε ne-a n mi n yɩɩdã, yẽ n são, yẽ keoor n leb n yɩɩda, bala yẽ bee ne malεgs bεdã sẽn yaa waglã, a tara keoor sẽn yaa wʋsgo, la b ka rɩk dargε-kãngã, sẽn yaa malεgã lagengã n kõ zẽng tɩ sã n ka yẽ ye, rẽnd na n yɩɩ wãnã ne ned ning sẽn ka ning a toaag wʋsg ne Wẽnd Gafã, n ka ruls-a, n ka maneg-a, n leb n ka karemd-a wʋsgo, wala yẽ sẽn karem-a halɩ n wa sε ne-a wã, na n yɩɩ wãnã tɩ b wa rɩk yẽ soabã n makd ne yãwã?",
          "A ɭbn Baaz yeelame (Wẽnd na yols-a): Ned sẽn mi Alkʋrãanã sõma la a ruls-a sõma wã, a bee ne mɑlεgs kãndgbã sẽn yaa waglã, sẽn yaa manegdbã: rat n na n yeelame t'a sã n karemd-a, ne yeelgẽ la a tʋʋmẽ, ka kareng bal ye, la a tõee a karengã sõma la a tʋmd ne-a, rẽnd a yasa ne-a, gomdẽ la maana pʋgẽ.",
        ],
