    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "A ra pa yɩ n yaa wẽng soab ye, pa gom-beed soab me, a pa ye-raoog soaba raas pʋgẽ ye, a pa rond wẽng ne wẽng ye, la ad a yaafdame la a basd tɩ loogdẽ",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ ʿAbd Allah Al-gεdaliy nengẽ, a yeelame: mam soaka a ʿAɑɩša sẽn yaa muumin-rãmbã ma wã (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã zʋgdã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ), t'a yeele: A ra pa yɩ n yaa wẽng soab ye, pa gom-beed soab me, a pa ye-raoog soaba raas pʋgẽ ye, a pa rond wẽng ne wẽng ye, la ad a yaafdame la a basd tɩ loogdẽ.",
    "explanation": "B soka muumin-rãmbã ma wã, a ʿAɑɩša (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) Nabiyaamã zʋgdo (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) t'a yeele: wẽng ra ka be a zʋgdẽ wã ye, wẽng pa be a gomẽ wã la a tʋʋmẽ wã ye, a ka modgd a meng n na n maan wẽnga, a ka maan pu-toog me, a ka wẽed no-bendo, a ka zẽkd a koεεgã raasẽ, a ka rond wẽng ne wẽnga, la ad a ronda wẽng ne sõma la a basd tɩ loogdẽ a sũurẽ wã la a balled n basd-a vẽeneg vẽenega.",
    "hints": [
