  11000: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "Ra tʋ-y mam Ṣahaabsã ye, ad yãmb yembr sã n yãk n naf sẽn zems wala Ʋhud tãngã tɩ yɑɑ sãnem, a kõn n ta b yembr nus a yiibu, ka b nus a yiibã pʋsʋk me",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Saʿɩɩd Al-ẖʋdriy nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: Nɑbiyɑɑmã yeelame (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ): «Ra tʋ-y mam Ṣahaabsã ye, ad yãmb yembr sã n yãk n naf sẽn zems wala Ʋhud tãngã tɩ yɑɑ sãnem, a kõn n ta b yembr nus a yiibu, ka b nus a yiibã pʋsʋk me».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã gɩdgame (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) tɩ b ra wa tʋ a Ṣahaabsã ye, sẽn yɩɩd fãa, sẽn reng-b taoor sẽn yaa Muhaagiriin la Ansaar-rãmbã; la a kõ kibare tɩ ned sẽn yi nebẽ wã sã n yãk n naf sẽn zems wala Ʋhud tãngã sãnem, a yel-sõmdã kõn n ta Ṣahaabg a yembr nus a yiibã sẽn ning rɩɩbo, maa a nus a yiibã pʋsʋka, la woto yaa b pʋ-peelemã sẽn yaa wʋsgã, la b Anni-rãmbã sẽn yaa sɩdã, la b sẽn reng n yãk n nafã, taoor tɩ Mak na n ka pake, bala tʋlsemã yɩɩ kãenkãe wakat-kãngã.",
    "hints": [
          "Ṣahaabsã tʋʋbo (Wẽnd yard be b yĩnga) yaa haraam, a bee Wẽnd kɩɩsgã sẽn yaa bedrã pʋga.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "B zemsa taab a zugu (A Al-Bʋẖaariy la a Muslim n reeg-a)",
