  11148: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "Ned kõ n kẽ Bugmã lae, rao sẽn seet Badr la Hʋdaybiyya",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Gεεbir nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga), a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma yeelame, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga): «Ned kõ n kẽ Bugmã lae, rao sẽn seet Badr la Hʋdaybiyya»",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kõo kibare, tɩ ned ka na n tol n kẽ Bugmã, ned ning sẽn wa Badr zabrã, zabr ning sẽn yɩ Higrã wã yʋʋm a yiibã, n lagem Nabiyaamã n zabe (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga). La Hʋdaybiyya manegrã, be me la bas-yard balengã sẽn yɩ wã, Higrã wã yʋʋm a yoob wakato.",
    "hints": [
          "Wilgda Badr la Hʋdaybiyya, yɩɩdlem ning sẽn be beenẽ, tɩ la ad bãmbã ka na n kẽ Bugmã lae.",
          "Vẽnegdame tɩ Wẽnde, (A Naam zẽk yã) A tusdame n yit bãmb zugu, sẽn yaa wẽgbã, b sẽn wẽg bãmb ne bũmb ningã, A gũud-b lame n yi rẽ, la A maan segl-sõng tɩ b maan kaalem sɩd-kũunã zugu, la A kẽes-b arzãna tɩ ka tũ ne Bugmã namsg sẽn reng taoor ye, la woto yaa Wẽnd yɩɩdlem t'A kõt A sẽn rata, la Wẽnd la yɩɩdlem bedr Soaba, n yaa Zɩslem Soaba.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "رواه أحمد وأصله في صحيح مسلم",
  },
  11161: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) yeela a Abuu Bakr la a Ʋmar: «bãmbã b yiibã la arzãn kom-pogse, rẽenem rãmbẽ la yaoolem rãmbẽ, sã n ka nabiyaam-rãmbã la tẽn-tʋʋmbã",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Anas nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) yeela a Abuu Bakr la a Ʋmar: «bãmbã b yiibã la arzãn kom-pogse, rẽenem rãmbẽ la yaoolem rãmbẽ, sã n ka nabiyaam-rãmbã la tẽn-tʋʋmbã».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) kõo kibare t'a Abuu Bakr As-Sidiik la a Ʋmar Al-faarʋʋk (Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga) bãmbã b yiibã la neb sẽn yɩɩd sõmblem nabiyaam-rãmbã poorẽ, sẽn na n leb n kẽ arzãn sõmblem n yɩɩde, Nabiyaam-rãmbã la Tẽn-tʋʋmbã poorẽ.",
    "hints": [
