  11169: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "A Hasan la a Hʋsayn, bãmb b yiibã yaa arzãnã rasãmb zu-raado",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Saʿʿɩɩd Al-ẖʋdriy nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame, Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), yeelame: «A Hasan la a Hʋsayn, bãmb b yiibã yaa arzãnã rasãmb zu-raado».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) kõo kibare, t'a yagens a yiibã, a Hasan la a Hʋsayne, sẽn yaa a Ali ɭbn Abɩɩ Taalib la a Faatima sẽn yaa Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) bi-puglã koambã, (Wẽnd yard be b yĩnga), tɩ bãmbã b yiibã la ned fãa sẽn maan kaalem n kẽ arzãna b zu-soab-rãmb a yiibu, maa yaa bãmb b yiibã la arzãnã koamb rasãmb zut-rãmba, zẽng sẽn ka nabiyaamã-rãmbã la Ṣahaabs nins sẽn leds Nabiyaamã sẽn yaa kãndegdbã.",
    "hints": [
          "Wilgda yɩɩdlem sẽn yaa vẽenega n kõ a Hasan la a Hʋsayn (Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga).",
          "B yeela hadiisã maana pʋgẽ: tɩ hadiisã yẽsg wakatã b rag n yaa arzãn koamb zu-soab-rãmba sẽn yaa zamaan-kãngã rasãmba, maa b yiibã n yɩɩd ned fãa sẽn ka tara yɩɩdlem sẽn gũbgã, wala nabiyaam-rãmbã la Nabiyaamã lεdsdbã, maa b yiibã yaa zut rãmba ne neb nins b sẽn sɩf-b rãmb ne rasãmdlem wala nedemdo, la kũuni la raoodo. La ka rasãndlemã yʋʋm la a rat ye, bala a Hasan la a Hʋsayne, b maana kaalem tɩ b yaa kom-pogdo.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A At-tirmiiziy la a Ahmad n togs-a",
  },
  11205: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "Yelsõmã lɑ zʋgd-rãmbã",
    "title": "Ad yaoogo, a yaa rẽenem sigb zĩig sẽn yaa laahr zagsã, tɩ ned sã n põs a pʋgẽ, sẽn watã yol-yol n yɩɩde, la a sã n ka põs a pʋgẽ, sẽn watã keelem n yɩɩde",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Haaniy nengẽ, sẽn yaa a ʿƲsmaan neema lalldã, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: a ʿƲsmaan ra yɩɩme t'a sã n yals yaoog zugu, a kũmdame halɩ t'a toεεngã madge, tɩ b yεεl-a: b tẽegda arzãn la Bugum yell tɩ fo ka kũmdẽ ye, n yaool n wa kũmd yãwã, t'a yeele: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A Tɩlgr be a yĩng) yeelɑme: «Ad yaoogo, a yaa rẽenem sigb zĩig sẽn yaa laahr zagsã, tɩ ned sã n põs a pʋgẽ, sẽn watã yol-yol n yɩɩde, la a sã n ka põs a pʋgẽ, sẽn watã keelem n yɩɩde».",
    "explanation": "Muumin-rãmbã naaba, a ʿƲsmaan, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) ra yɩɩme, t'a sã n yals yaoogẽ, a yãbdame halɩ t'a nintãmã madg a toεεngã, tɩ b yεεl-a: B tẽegda arzãn la Bugum yell tɩ fo ka kũmdẽ ye, tɩ yaa sẽn rat n tall nong-kεgeng ne arzãnã maa rɑbeem n yi Bugm! La f yaool n kũmd yaoogã kũm-kũma? La a yeel yã tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) kõo kibar tɩ yaoogã la rẽenem sigb zĩig sẽn yaa laahr zagsẽ wã, la a sã n põse, n tɩlg n yi yẽ, zags nins sẽn ketã naana n yɩɩde, la a sã n ka tɩlg n yi yaoogã namsgo, sẽn watã sẽn yaa nang wʋsgã, yẽ keelem n yɩɩde.",
    "hints": [
          "Wilgda bũmb ninga a ʿƲsmaan, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) sẽn da be a soab zugã, sẽn yaa Wẽn-zoεεga (A Naam zẽk yã), n lagem ne a sẽn be neb nins Nabiyaamã sẽn noog-b rãmb sũy ne arzãnã kõom.",
          "Yaa tɩ sãri wã kõo sor tɩ ned kũm yaoogã yεla tẽegrẽ la dũni yikr yεlã.",
          "A tabenda yaoogã neemã la a nangã.",
          "A bugsdame n yit yaoogã nangã.",
        ],
    "grade": "Hasanʋn (be neere)",
    "attribution": "A At-tirmiiziy la a ɭbn Maaǧa n togs-a",
  },
  11210: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "Yãmb yembr sã n maan kaalem, b ballda a zĩndgã zĩigã, yibeoog la zaabre",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAbd Allaah ɭbn ʿAmr nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga), tɩ Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) a yeelame: «Yãmb yembr sã n maan kaalem, b ballda a zĩndgã zĩigã, yibeoog la zaabre, sã n mik tɩ yaa arzãn neda yaa arzan neda, la sã n mik tɩ yaa Bugum neda yaa Bugum neda, tɩ b yeel-a: yãwã la fo zĩiga, halɩ tɩ Wẽnd wa tʋg n yik-fo alkiyaoom raarã».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) kõo kibare, tɩ yamb sã n maan kaalem, b ballda a sigbã zĩiga la zĩig ning sẽn welg ne yẽ toorã, arzãnẽ wã maa Bugmẽ wã, wĩndgã sɩngrẽ la a baasgẽ, arzãnẽ wã tɩ sã n mik tɩ yaa arzãn neda, la Bugmẽ wã tɩ sã n mik tɩ yaa Bugum neda, n yeel-a: Woto yaa fo zĩig ninga b sẽn na n wa yik foom tɩ f kẽng dũni yikr raarã, la wʋm-noog be a pʋgẽ ne sɩd-kõtbã, la nang be a pʋgẽ ne kɩfr-rãmbã.",
    "hints": [
          "Yaoogã namsgã la a neemã wã yaa sɩda.",
          "A ɭbn Hagar yeelame (Wẽnd na yols-a): Ad ball-kãngã ne sɩd-kõt la Wẽnd zoεta la kɩfrã yaa vẽenega, la sã n yaa sɩd-kõt ning sẽn gẽdgã wã, a tõeeme n ball a zĩndgã zĩig arzãnẽ wã n wilg-a, a sẽn na tʋg n baas a pʋgẽ wã yĩnga.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "B zemsa taab a zugu (A Al-Bʋẖaariy la a Muslim n reeg-a)",
  },
  11220: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "Loeegã",
    "title": "Yel-kãngã na n taa zĩig fãa yʋng la wĩndg sẽn taẽ, la Wẽnd ka na n bas tẽng pʋgẽ roto, A ka na n bas gãnd zagse, rẽndame t'A kẽes-a dĩin-kãngã",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Tamiim Ad-daary nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame, Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) a yeelame: «Yel-kãngã na n taa zĩig fãa yʋng la wĩndg sẽn taẽ, la Wẽnd ka na n bas tẽng pʋgẽ roto, A ka na n bas gãnd zagse, rẽndame t'A kẽes-a dĩin-kãngã, ne nin-tɩrg tɩrlem, mɑɑ yaand yaalgo, tɩrlem Wẽnd sẽn na n zɩsg lɩslaamdã ne-a, la yaalgo Wẽnd sẽn na n yaal kɩfẽndã ne-a». La a Tamiim Ad-daary rag n yɩɩme n yetẽ: mam bãnga yel-kãngã m zakã rãmbẽ, ad neb nins sẽn tuubã b paama sõmblem la zɩslem la zu-zẽkre, la neb nins sẽn kell n pa kɩfẽndã pʋgẽ wã yaalg la paoogr la yãnd n paam-ba.",
    "explanation": "Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) kõta kibare, tɩ ad dĩin-kãngã, a na n gũbga ween-n-vɩɩsã fãa, zĩig ning fãa wĩndgã la yʋngã sẽn tatẽ, dĩin-kãngã na n taa beenẽ, la Wẽnde, (A Naam zẽk yã) A ka na n bas zaka, tẽng pʋgẽ maa tẽn-bãanegẽ wã, maa we-raadẽ wã rẽndame t'A kẽes-a dĩin-kãngã, rẽnd ned ning sẽn saka dĩin-kãngã, n kõ sɩd ne-a, a na n yɩɩ zɩsg ne lɩslaamdã zɩslem, la ned ning sẽn tõdga la a kɩflg ne-a, a na n yɩɩ yaalga, b sẽn yaal a soaba,\n\nrẽ poorẽ tɩ Ṣahaabga a Tamiim Ad-daary (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) kõ kibare, tɩ yẽ bãnga yell ning Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) sẽn kõ kibarã, yẽ zakã rãmb nengẽ, rẽnd neb nins sẽn sak n tuubã b paama sõma la zugendu la zɩslem, la sẽn kɩflbã paama yaalgo, n pɑɑs yẽ sẽn kõt lɩslaambã arzεgsã, (sẽn na yɩl tɩ b gũ-a).",
    "hints": [
          "Yaa kiba-noog ne lɩslaambã tɩ b dĩinã, a na n sẽega Tẽng gãngã zug fãa.",
          "Zɩslem yaa lɩslaangã la lɩslaambã n so, la yaalg yaa kɩfẽnd la kɩfr-rãmbã n so.",
          "Be a pʋgẽ sẽn yaa Nabiyaamdmã tagmas-rãmba, la bãngr sẽn be bãng-rãmbẽ wã, ne yellã sẽn yɩ wala Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) sẽn kõ kibarã.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A Ahmad n togs-a",
  },
  11231: {
    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "Fighu wã ne Yẽgã",
    "title": "Yãmb yembr fãa sã n maan sik a Pʋʋsgẽ, n ka mi yẽ sẽn pʋʋsã yaa wãnɑ, tãab bɩ naase, bɩ a yãk sikã tεk n lobe, la a rogl yẽ sẽn tar bas-m-yamã zugu, rẽ poorẽ bɩ a maan suguud a yiibu taoor t'a na n ka ning sallem",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Saʿʿɩɩd Al-ẖʋdriy nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga), a yeelame, Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga), yeelame: «Yãmb yembr fãa sã n maan sik a Pʋʋsgẽ, n ka mi yẽ sẽn pʋʋsã yaa wãnɑ, tãab bɩ naase, bɩ a yãk sikã tεk n lobe, la a rogl yẽ sẽn tar bas-m-yamã zugu, rẽ poorẽ bɩ a maan suguud a yiibu taoor t'a na n ka ning sallem, sã n da mikame t'a Pʋʋsgã yaa a nu, suguud sahwiwã (yĩmbã suguudã) na n sũgsã a Pʋʋsgã n manege, la sã n mikame t'a sẽn pʋʋsã yaa sẽn pid naase, suguud a yiibã yɩta a sʋɩtãan yõ-tẽgre».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) vẽnegame, tɩ pʋʋsd sã n maan yam yoogo, n ka mi a sẽn pʋʋsã yaa wãnɑ, yaa tãab bɩ yaa naase, bɩ a lobg rakaar ning sẽn paasa n yaa sikã, la a ra geel-a ye, bala yaa tãabã la bas-m-yamã sẽn be wã, rẽnd a pʋʋsda rakaar a naase n paase, rẽ poorẽ bɩ a maan suguud a yiibu, taoor t'a ka ning sallem ye.\n\nSã n mik t'a sẽn pʋʋsã hakɩɩk rag n yaa naase; woto lebgga nu, yẽ sẽn paas rakaar ningã, la yĩmbã suguudã yẽ sẽn maanã, bãmb ledgda rakaarã, rẽnd kɩtame tɩ sõorã ka tar lugum ye, la sã n mikame tɩ yẽnda sẽn Pʋʋsã n lagem ne rakaarã fãa yaa naase, mikdame t'a maana bũmb ning sẽn be ne-a wã, a ka paase, a ka booge.\n\nLa yẽ sẽn maan yĩmbã suguud a yiibã lebgame masa tɩ yaa yaalg tusb ne a sʋɩɩtãana, n lebsda a sʋɩɩtãan t'a yɑɑ yaalgɑ tɩ b zãag-a t'a ka paam a sẽn rat-a ye, bala a sʋɩtãan gẽdga yẽ Pʋʋsgã n rat n na n sãam-a, la Ādem biig Pʋʋsgã pidame, a sẽn wa n sak Wẽnd sagellã sẽn yeel t'a maan suguudã, suguud ning a sʋɩɩtãan sẽn kɩɩs Wẽnd n ka maanɑ, a sẽn wa n tõdg tɩ yẽ ka na n sak Wẽnd n maan a Ādem suguudã.",
    "hints": [
          "Pʋʋsd sã n maan sika a Pʋʋsgã pʋgẽ, tɩ yell baa a yembr ka wil yẽ nengẽ ye, rẽnd a lobda sikã la a tʋm ne bũmb ning sẽn yaa vẽeneg a nengẽ, la yẽ me la bũmb ning sẽn paood n yɩɩd Pʋʋsgã pʋgẽ wã, rẽnd a pidsda a Pʋʋsgã yẽnda zugu, la a maan yĩmb suguud taoor t'a ka ning sallem ye, rẽ poorẽ t'a ning sallemã.",
          "Suguud a yiib-kãensã, b yaa sor sẽn rɩk n na n yẽd Pʋʋsgã sẽn besgã, n leb n yaa lebsg ne a sʋɩɩtãan t'a yaa yaalga, n yaa b sẽn zãag a soaba n yi a raabã.",
          "Sik ning b sẽn gom hadiisẽ wã, yẽnda la yam yaal-yaal ning sẽn ka tara wilbã, tẽeb la wilb sã n zĩndi, b tʋmda ne rẽ.",
          "Yaa b sẽn kengd tɩ b zab ne yuus-yuusã la b tus-a sẽn tũ ne Wẽnd sãri wã gãdbo.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A Muslim n togs-a",
  },
  11249: {
    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "Fighu wã ne Yẽgã",
    "title": "Tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ), a yɩɩme n ka basd rakaar a naase, taoor t'a na n ka pʋʋs Zafare, la rakaar a yiibu, taoor t'a na n ka pʋʋs fagiri",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAɑɩša sẽn yaa muumin-rãmbã ma wã nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga): Tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ), a yɩɩme n ka basd rakaar a naase, taoor t'a na n ka pʋʋs Zafare, la rakaar a yiibu, taoor t'a na n ka pʋʋs fagiri.",
    "explanation": "A ʿAɑɩša (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) kõo kibare, tɩ Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) a ra yɩɩme n duum naafɩl-rãmb Pʋʋsgo, a zakẽ wẽ, a ka basd-b ye: rakaar a naase ne sallem a yiibu, taoor tɩ Zafar na n ka pʋʋse, la rakaar a yiibu taoor tɩ fagir na n ka pʋʋse.",
    "hints": [
          "Wilgdame tɩ b maana nonglem tɩ b gũus rakaar a naas pʋʋsgo, taoor tɩ Zafar na n ka pʋʋs ye, la rakaar a yiibu, taoor tɩ fagir na n ka pʋʋse.",
          "Sõma sẽn yɩɩd yaa b pʋʋs Naafɩl-rãmb nins sẽn maand wakat-rãmbã poorẽ wã a zakẽ wã, rẽ n kɩt t'a ʿAɑɩša (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) togse.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
    "attribution": "A Al-Bʋẖaariy n togs-a",
