    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) vẽnegame n wilgdẽ, tɩ paga, a fur ka manegde, rẽndame tɩ tũ ne biig ba, sẽn na n yik n yals ne fura loeese.",
