    "hadeeth": "Yii a 'Abd Allaah ɭbn 'Ʋmar nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be b yiibã yĩnga) tɩ ad Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) yikɑme ɑ sẽn lob a Al-aslamiy poorẽ, n yeele: «Zãag-y yel-kãensã Wẽnd sẽn gɩdgã, rẽnd ned ning sẽn wa n tʋg n kẽ yellã pʋgẽ, bɩ a bao sʋtr Wẽnd nengẽ, la a tuub n tʋg Wẽnd nengẽ, tɩ ad ned ning sẽn wa n vẽneg a tʋʋmã seb-nengɑ, tõnd na n maana Wẽnd sẽn saglã a zugu (A Naam yɩ wagell n zẽke)».",
