    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Hʋrayrat nengẽ, (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) a kãaba zãmb soaba la sẽn reegd-a n na n maan zãmbã bʋʋd pʋgẽ.",
