    "explanation": "Nɑbiyɑɑmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) vẽnegame n wilg tɩ ned ning sẽn yaga yẽnda tɩ yaa pʋ-toogo, zem tɩ yaa koεεg maa tʋʋm la a rɩk n tees Nabiyaamã, tɩ yaa zĩri-beedo, t'a soab tara yaoolem raarã zĩndig zĩig Bugmã pʋgẽ, tɩ yaa rolb yẽ sẽn yag n rogl Nabiyaamã yĩnga.",
