    "hadeeth": "Yii a Bʋrayda nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋmã, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) yeelame: «Ad alkaool ning sẽn be tõnd ne b sʋka, yaa Pʋʋsgã, rẽnd ned ning sẽn bas-a, a kɩflame».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) vẽnegdame n wilgdẽ, tɩ ad alkaoolã ne no-rɩkra lɩslaambã la neb a taabã sʋka, sẽn yaa kɩfr-rãmb la munaafɩgsã, yaa Pʋʋsgo, rẽnd ned ning sẽn basa Pʋʋsgã, a kɩflame.",
