  65095: {
    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "Fighu wã ne Yẽgã",
    "title": "A Bilaale, yals Pʋʋsgã, pems-d ne-a",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Saalim ɭbn Abɩɩ Gε’ɩd nengẽ, a yeelame, tɩ raoa n yeele: m sã n paam n pʋʋsẽ, n vʋʋse, tɩ yaa wala neb nins sẽn be ne-a wã, b zanga yel-kãngã t'a yeele : m wʋma Wẽnd Tẽn-tʋʋma, (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) t’a yetẽ: «A Bilaale, yals Pʋʋsgã, pems-d ne-a».",
    "explanation": "Rao n zĩnd sahaabsẽ wã n yeele: m sã n paam n pʋʋsẽ, n vʋʋs yã, tɩ yaa wala neb nins sẽn be ne-a wã, b zanga yel-kãngã, t'a yeele: mam wʋma Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) t'a yetẽ: Bilaale! Tak laandãanã la f yals Pʋʋsgã tɩ d paam n vʋʋs ne Pʋʋsgã, la sẽn yet rẽndã wã yaa bũmb ning sẽn be Pʋʋsgã pʋgẽ sẽn yaa sõsg ne Wẽnde, n leb n yaa vʋʋsg ne yõorã la sũurã.",
    "hints": [
          "Sũurã vʋʋsgã a yɩta ne Pʋʋsgã, bala Wẽnd sõsg-n-taar n be beenẽ, (A Naam zẽkame).",
          "Bee hadiisã pʋgẽ kisgri ne ned ning sẽn tara kʋɩɩng ne Pʋʋsgã.",
          "Wilgdame tɩ ned ning sẽn wa n maan waagib ning sẽn be a zugã, la a rok bũmb ning sẽn be a zugã n base, a paamda vʋʋsgo la yĩn-yõgnego.",
        ],
    "grade": "Naṣʋn Ṣahɩɩhʋn (Gom-sikdem sẽn manege)",
