    "hadeeth": "Yii a ʿAbdʋllaah ɭbn Mugaffal nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: Naniyaamã yeelame (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga): «Laandãan-rãmb a yiib sʋk fãa Pʋʋsg n be , laandãan-rãmb a yiib sʋk fãa Pʋʋsg n be». Rẽ poorẽ t'a yeele: «Ne ned ning sẽn tʋlla».",
