    "explanation": "Nɑbiyɑɑmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) bugsdame tɩ b ra bas arzũmã Pʋʋsg ye, la ad ned ning sẽn basa arzũm-rãmb a tãab Pʋʋsgo, ne yam yaal-yaale la maan-n-kʋʋge, tɩ padang ka be, Wẽnd pagda a sũurã, t'a gɩdgd sõmã wã tɩ ka tat-a ye.",
