    "title": "Ad b tʋmsa maam tɩ m pids zʋg-waglã wã",
    "hadeeth": "Yii a Abɩɩ Hʋrayrat nengẽ (Wẽnd yard be a yĩnga) a yeelame: Wẽnde Tẽn-tʋʋmã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩngɑ) a yeelame: «Ad b tʋmsa maam tɩ m pids zʋg-waglã wã».",
    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) kõo kibare, tɩ ad Wẽnd tʋmsa yẽnda, (A Naam yɩ wagell n zẽke), sen na yɩl t'a pids zʋg-waglã la zʋg-sõmsã wã, bala b tʋmsa Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) n na n pids sẽn reng b taoor sẽn yaa Tẽn-tʋʋmbã, la a pids zʋgd nins sẽn manegã, sẽn yaa nedemdo la kũune la raoodo; tɩ b tʋms Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) t'a na n wa pids boog-kãensã, sẽn be zʋgdẽ wã, wala pugd taab ne buudu, la waoog-m-menga, la talg paoogre la zẽng sẽn ka rẽnda.",
    "hints": [
          "Hadiisã kengdame tɩ b maan zʋg-waglã wã la a gɩdgd zʋg wẽnsã.",
          "Wilgda zʋg-sõmsã sẽn ta zĩig ninga lɩslaangã sãri wã pʋgẽ, n wilgdẽ t'a bee a yεl rẽemsã pʋgẽ.",
          "Zɩɩlmã rãmba, b ra tara zʋg-sõma sãnda, sẽn be a pʋgẽ yaa kũuni la raoodo la zẽng sẽn pa rẽ, rẽnd lɩslaangã waame n na n pids-ba.",
