    "explanation": "Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg lɑ A tɩlgr be ɑ yĩngɑ) kõo kibare, tɩ Wẽnde, (A Naam zẽk yã) A yeta Hadiis Alƙudsi wã pʋgẽ, ad ninsaala, a namsda Maam la a paoogd Maam, ned ning sẽn tʋʋda la a sãbsd zãmaanã masɩɩb-rãmb la yel-toodã sẽn wat n sigã; bala yaa Yẽnda, (A Naam yɩlg yã) Yẽ la Rabsdã, A Yembr Tãa, Yẽ n leb n kẽnesd bũmb ning sẽn yɩtã, rẽnd zãmaanã toogã yaa Wẽnd toogo (A Naam yɩ wagell n zẽke) la zamaanã yaa bõn-naandga, b sẽn wõre, tɩ yεlã maand a pʋgẽ ne sagell la raabo (A Naam zẽk yã).",
    "hints": [
          "Hadiis-kãngã bee hadiis-rãmb nins Nabiyaamã (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la A tɩlgr be a yĩnga) sẽn togsde, tɩ yaa sẽn yi a Soabã nengẽ, b boond-a lame tɩ hadiis AlƘʋdsɩy (hadiis yɩlenga) maa hadiis ɭlaahiy (Wẽnd hadiisi) yẽ me la hadiis ninga, a gom-biisã la a maanã wã yii Wẽnd nengẽ, la mikame t'a ka tar Alkʋrãanã sẽn tar yεl ninsã ye, b sẽn tũud Wẽnd ne a karengã, la b yɩlgd a yĩnga, la a leb n geesd la a komsd nebã tɩ b ka tõe n wa ne a buud ye, la zẽng sẽn ka rẽndã Hadiis Alƙʋdsy wã sẽn ka tarã.",
          "Wilgdame tɩ b maan zʋgd ne Wẽnde, gomdẽ la loεεgẽ.",
