          "Zãmaanã tʋʋrã la a sɩfã, a yɩta buk a tãabo: 1-yaa a sẽn na n tʋʋd zãmaanã tɩ bala yaa yẽ n maane; la yaa zãmaanã me n leebd yεlã n kẽngd sõma la wẽnga! Rẽnd yãwã yaa lagem-n-ta-kẽenga, bala yẽnda loeeme tɩ naand n be n lagem Wẽnde, n leb n paase, yẽ rɩka yεla yɩɩbã n kõ zẽng sẽn ka Wẽnde. 2-Yaa a sẽn na tʋ zamaanã la ka a sẽn loe tɩ yaa zãmaanã n maand ye, la yaa a sẽn loe tɩ Wẽnd n maane, la a tʋʋd-a lame, bala yel-kãngã yẽ sẽn ka ratã, yaa zãmaanã pʋg la a yi yã, tɩ yẽ tʋʋd zamaanã, rẽnd yãwã yaa haraam. 3-Yaa sẽn na n mik tɩ yaa kibar bal la a kõta, la ka sãbsg ye; yãwã sakdame, la sẽn yɩ boto yaa a Luut koεεga (Wẽnd pʋʋsg la a tɩlgr be a yĩnga) {Ad yãwã yaa ra-kεgengɑ}.",
